<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.300" end="00:00:04.900" style="s2">I opened my mouth, but no sound came</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.600" end="00:00:06.300" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.900" end="00:00:08.800" style="s2">The nurse wiped the tears from the</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.300" end="00:00:11.400" style="s2">corner of my ears.</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.800" end="00:00:14.500" style="s2">It was a boy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.400" end="00:00:14.500" style="s2">She said softly.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.800" end="00:00:19.600" style="s2">I had not even named him yet.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.800" end="00:00:21.300" style="s2">I had not even let Adrian hear his</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.600" end="00:00:22.900" style="s2">heartbeat once.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.300" end="00:00:25.600" style="s2">I&#39;ve imagined what he looked like</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.900" end="00:00:28.400" style="s2">countless times in my mind, whether as a</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.600" end="00:00:30.500" style="s2">boy or a girl. I love my child deeply,</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.400" end="00:00:32.900" style="s2">yet he simply vanished, disappearing</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.500" end="00:00:35.200" style="s2">from my life forever. I am no longer his</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.900" end="00:00:36.700" style="s2">mother. He has left me forever.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.200" end="00:00:39.200" style="s2">The night before our wedding, my mother</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.700" end="00:00:40.200" style="s2">needed a $50,000 emergency deposit for</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.200" end="00:00:43.100" style="s2">surgery.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.200" end="00:00:46.900" style="s2">I went to my fiancé, major Adrian Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.100" end="00:00:48.400" style="s2">Dear, my mother needs surgery tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.900" end="00:00:49.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So everything my parents and Madeline</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.400" end="00:00:50.400" style="s2">said was true? You were only with me for</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.900" end="00:00:52.200" style="s2">my money?</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.400" end="00:00:54.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I tried to explain, but he was already</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.200" end="00:00:56.000" style="s2">looking at me like a stranger. He paid</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.000" end="00:00:58.300" style="s2">the deposit in the end. The money got my</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.000" end="00:00:59.900" style="s2">mother into surgery. It did not keep her</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.300" end="00:01:01.500" style="s2">alive.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.900" end="00:01:05.200" style="s2">After that, every time I asked him for</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.500" end="00:01:05.200" style="s2">help, he sent me $100.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.400" end="00:01:13.600" style="s2">When I was in a car accident, he sent</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.400" end="00:01:15.400" style="s2">$100.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.600" end="00:01:18.300" style="s2">When I begged him to attend my mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.400" end="00:01:19.900" style="s2">funeral, he sent $100.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.300" end="00:01:22.800" style="s2">8 months ago, I found out I was</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.900" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">pregnant. I sent him 99 voice messages,</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.800" end="00:01:27.100" style="s2">desperate to tell him we were having a</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.200" end="00:01:29.500" style="s2">baby. He never listened. He only sent 99</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.100" end="00:01:31.000" style="s2">payments of $100.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.500" end="00:01:33.300" style="s2">For months, I had come to every</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.000" end="00:01:36.400" style="s2">appointment alone. Blood tests,</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.300" end="00:01:38.100" style="s2">ultrasounds, fetal monitoring, payments,</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.400" end="00:01:40.100" style="s2">and prescriptions were all things I</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.100" end="00:01:41.800" style="s2">handled by myself. After the prenatal</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.100" end="00:01:44.500" style="s2">checkup, the doctor pushed the report</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.800" end="00:01:46.400" style="s2">toward me. Nora, you are almost 8 months</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.500" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">pregnant, and this is a high-risk</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.400" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">pregnancy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:52.100" style="s2">There is a chance of premature labor. If</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.000" end="00:01:54.900" style="s2">things worsen, we may need an emergency</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.100" end="00:01:56.900" style="s2">C-section. Can your husband come in?</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.900" end="00:01:59.400" style="s2">I took out my phone and sent Adrian a</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.900" end="00:02:02.692" style="s2">voice message.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.400" end="00:02:04.392" style="s2">The doctor says the may come early.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.692" end="00:02:06.392" style="s2">Can you come to the hospital?</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.392" end="00:02:09.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A minute later, my phone vibrated. Only</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.392" end="00:02:12.192" style="s2">a transfer. Adrian Hayes sent you $100.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.492" end="00:02:14.392" style="s2">The note read, need money again? At that</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.192" end="00:02:16.092" style="s2">moment, I stared at the note in my hand,</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.392" end="00:02:19.792" style="s2">never knowing that my baby and I had</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.092" end="00:02:19.792" style="s2">only 4 hours left to live.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.092" end="00:02:23.292" style="s2">The doctor must have seen too many women</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.792" end="00:02:25.792" style="s2">trying to stay composed at the payment</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.292" end="00:02:27.992" style="s2">desk. If you cannot be admitted today,</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.792" end="00:02:29.892" style="s2">go home and watch yourself closely. If</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.992" end="00:02:31.692" style="s2">you have bleeding, abdominal pain,</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.892" end="00:02:33.492" style="s2">regular contractions, or reduced fetal</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.692" end="00:02:35.192" style="s2">movement, do not wait.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.492" end="00:02:37.192" style="s2">Go straight to the emergency room. She</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.192" end="00:02:38.592" style="s2">handed me a small paper bag. This</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.192" end="00:02:40.492" style="s2">medication may help stabilize the</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.592" end="00:02:42.392" style="s2">contractions for now, but it is not a</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.492" end="00:02:44.792" style="s2">substitute for observation. Do you</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.392" end="00:02:47.092" style="s2">understand? Thank you. I folded the</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.792" end="00:02:48.992" style="s2">discharge instructions into my bag and</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.092" end="00:02:50.892" style="s2">left the hospital with one hand over my</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.992" end="00:02:52.592" style="s2">belly. After I left the hospital, I</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.892" end="00:02:54.392" style="s2">stood by the curb and called Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.592" end="00:02:57.192" style="s2">Before dialing, I had already prepared</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.392" end="00:03:00.292" style="s2">myself for him not to answer. This time,</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.192" end="00:03:01.992" style="s2">the call connected after a single ring.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.292" end="00:03:03.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.992" end="00:03:05.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There were voices in the background</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.692" end="00:03:07.492" style="s2">along with the sound of a band tuning</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.492" end="00:03:09.492" style="s2">instruments.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.492" end="00:03:11.392" style="s2">I held the small paper bag of medication</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.492" end="00:03:13.092" style="s2">in my hand and said, the hospital told</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.392" end="00:03:14.592" style="s2">me to go home and watch myself. You do</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.092" end="00:03:16.192" style="s2">not need to come and you not need to</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.592" end="00:03:17.992" style="s2">send money. For a moment, the line went</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.192" end="00:03:19.792" style="s2">quiet. Then Madeleine&#39;s voice came</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.992" end="00:03:21.392" style="s2">through. See, I told you she would</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.792" end="00:03:22.992" style="s2">change the story. A minute ago, the baby</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.392" end="00:03:24.992" style="s2">was in danger. Now suddenly you do not</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.992" end="00:03:25.692" style="s2">need to come. Adrian, she only wanted</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.992" end="00:03:28.092" style="s2">you to panic.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.692" end="00:03:29.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, I am not lying.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.092" end="00:03:31.492" style="s2">The doctor said</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.592" end="00:03:33.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I almost fell for it again. Nora, this</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.492" end="00:03:35.492" style="s2">is low even for you. Using the baby as</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.992" end="00:03:37.292" style="s2">an excuse?</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.492" end="00:03:39.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I stood outside the hospital for a long</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.292" end="00:03:40.992" style="s2">time without moving. Adrian had once</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.192" end="00:03:42.992" style="s2">looked at me as if I were the only thing</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.992" end="00:03:44.792" style="s2">he was sure of before he became Major</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.992" end="00:03:46.692" style="s2">Hayes, before dressed uniforms and</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.792" end="00:03:49.092" style="s2">command briefings hardened every line of</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.692" end="00:03:51.192" style="s2">him. He had been the 22-year-old officer</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.092" end="00:03:52.492" style="s2">who fought his family to marry me until</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.192" end="00:03:54.092" style="s2">the night before the wedding when I</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.492" end="00:03:56.692" style="s2">asked him for the money. After that, the</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.092" end="00:03:58.892" style="s2">name remained Barracks Golddigger,</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.692" end="00:04:00.892" style="s2">Officer Hunter, the woman who married a</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.892" end="00:04:02.894" style="s2">major for his paycheck.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.892" end="00:04:04.294" style="s2">His friends joked about it, and Adrian</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.894" end="00:04:06.694" style="s2">never corrected them.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.294" end="00:04:08.494" style="s2">Sometimes, when he was angry enough, he</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.694" end="00:04:10.394" style="s2">even smiled. We remained legally</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.494" end="00:04:13.494" style="s2">married, but in every other way we</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.394" end="00:04:13.494" style="s2">became strangers.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.494" end="00:04:18.694" style="s2">By the time I returned to base housing,</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.794" end="00:04:20.994" style="s2">the sky had gone dark. My phone</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.694" end="00:04:24.194" style="s2">vibrated.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.994" end="00:04:24.994" style="s2">Adrian Hayes sent you $100.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.194" end="00:04:26.994" style="s2">The note read</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.994" end="00:04:27.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m ashamed our child has a liar for a</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.994" end="00:04:30.094" style="s2">mother.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.494" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tears fell before I could stop them.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.094" end="00:04:33.794" style="s2">The old photo of us was still on the</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.894" end="00:04:35.994" style="s2">dining table.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.794" end="00:04:37.994" style="s2">In it, Adrian had just completed officer</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.994" end="00:04:40.694" style="s2">training. He had his arm around my</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.994" end="00:04:42.494" style="s2">shoulders and pride in his eyes, as if</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.694" end="00:04:44.094" style="s2">he had finally kept the one thing he</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.494" end="00:04:45.994" style="s2">wanted most.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.094" end="00:04:47.894" style="s2">Back then, he was not Major Hayes to</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.994" end="00:04:49.294" style="s2">everyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.894" end="00:04:50.694" style="s2">He was only</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.294" end="00:04:52.994" style="s2">Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.694" end="00:04:54.494" style="s2">The Adrian who fought his family for me,</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.994" end="00:04:56.594" style="s2">who was thrown out and still worked</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.494" end="00:04:58.794" style="s2">three jobs to save for a ring. I turned</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.594" end="00:05:00.994" style="s2">the photo face down on the table.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.794" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">The medication sat on my night stand. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.994" end="00:05:05.394" style="s2">sat on the edge of the bed and placed my</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.194" end="00:05:07.294" style="s2">hand over my belly.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.394" end="00:05:08.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just wait a little longer, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.294" end="00:05:10.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I had just changed into my pajamas and</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.994" end="00:05:11.894" style="s2">was about to lie down when Adrian</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.594" end="00:05:13.894" style="s2">called.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.894" end="00:05:15.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Family readiness reception.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.894" end="00:05:17.294" style="s2">Tonight. You&#39;re coming.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.994" end="00:05:18.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t feel well.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.294" end="00:05:20.894" style="s2">The doctor told me to stay home and</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.794" end="00:05:22.294" style="s2">watch myself, not attend an event.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.894" end="00:05:23.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were discharged, weren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.294" end="00:05:25.294" style="s2">Command has asked more than once why my</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.694" end="00:05:27.094" style="s2">wife never shows up to family readiness</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.294" end="00:05:27.894" style="s2">events. Sign in, stand there for 20</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.094" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">minutes, then go home.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.894" end="00:05:30.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, I really can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.194" end="00:05:31.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop using the hospital as an excuse.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.794" end="00:05:33.294" style="s2">You have embarrassed me enough over</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.994" end="00:05:35.094" style="s2">money. Do not make me answer questions</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.294" end="00:05:36.694" style="s2">about you tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.094" end="00:05:38.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The call ended.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.694" end="00:05:39.394" style="s2">I sat on the edge of the bed for a long</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.294" end="00:05:41.894" style="s2">time</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.394" end="00:05:45.394" style="s2">before changing into a loose coat and</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.894" end="00:05:45.394" style="s2">taking a cab to the reception.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.294" end="00:05:49.894" style="s2">The event was held in a low building</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.794" end="00:05:51.994" style="s2">near the parade ground. Officers and</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.894" end="00:05:53.894" style="s2">spouses stood in small circles beneath</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.994" end="00:05:55.594" style="s2">bright lights. Madeleine stood behind</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.894" end="00:05:57.394" style="s2">the check-in table with a volunteer</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.594" end="00:05:59.794" style="s2">badge pinned to her gown, handing out</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.394" end="00:06:01.994" style="s2">name tags. When she saw me come in, she</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.794" end="00:06:02.994" style="s2">turned to Adrian with a smile.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.994" end="00:06:05.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.994" end="00:06:05.595" style="s2">She made it here just fine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.094" end="00:06:08.495" style="s2">I told</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.595" end="00:06:10.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you not to rush and send the deposit.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.495" end="00:06:12.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian came over and held the pen out to</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.495" end="00:06:12.695" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.695" end="00:06:16.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.095" end="00:06:19.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I took it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.195" end="00:06:21.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora, $3,800 doesn&#39;t really sound like</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.095" end="00:06:22.995" style="s2">an admission deposit. It sounds more</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.195" end="00:06:24.695" style="s2">like a number you made up.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.995" end="00:06:26.595" style="s2">Next time you use the baby to ask for</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.695" end="00:06:29.995" style="s2">money, at least check with the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.595" end="00:06:29.995" style="s2">first so you don&#39;t get caught.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.595" end="00:06:34.895" style="s2">The baby isn&#39;t even born yet and she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.395" end="00:06:36.195" style="s2">already turned him into a payment plan.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.895" end="00:06:37.895" style="s2">Girls with no family money learn</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.195" end="00:06:42.195" style="s2">paperwork fast.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.895" end="00:06:42.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I would never use my child for money.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.395" end="00:06:46.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop putting him on every bill.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.795" end="00:06:51.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora, stop lying. What will the child</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.995" end="00:06:51.895" style="s2">learn from you if this is how you</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.095" end="00:06:53.395" style="s2">behave?</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.895" end="00:06:54.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finish signing and leave. I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.395" end="00:06:57.195" style="s2">the whole base knowing my wife curses</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.895" end="00:06:58.995" style="s2">her own child just to get money from me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.195" end="00:07:01.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever explanation I still had left</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.995" end="00:07:03.495" style="s2">went cold. I signed the last line, put</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.395" end="00:07:06.195" style="s2">down the pen, and turned away before he</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.495" end="00:07:06.195" style="s2">could dismiss me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.695" end="00:07:11.649" style="s2">I had only made it halfway across the</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.195" end="00:07:13.595" style="s2">walkway when the pain slammed down again</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.649" end="00:07:16.295" style="s2">[gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.595" end="00:07:19.195" style="s2">as if something inside me had torn open.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.295" end="00:07:19.195" style="s2">I caught the railing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.495" end="00:07:24.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, what happened to her?</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.495" end="00:07:26.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I texted Adrian first. I&#39;m bleeding. I</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.195" end="00:07:30.095" style="s2">need the ER. Then I called him. He</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.795" end="00:07:30.095" style="s2">answered on the fourth ring.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.295" end="00:07:35.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora, I am warning you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.495" end="00:07:36.495" style="s2">Stop using the baby to lie to me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.295" end="00:07:38.195" style="s2">Your due date is in the middle of next</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.495" end="00:07:40.595" style="s2">month. When the time comes, I will cover</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.195" end="00:07:42.695" style="s2">every delivery expense, including a VIP</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.595" end="00:07:44.395" style="s2">room. Until then, stop acting like a</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.695" end="00:07:45.095" style="s2">gold digger and making up reasons to ask</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.395" end="00:07:47.675" style="s2">for money.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.095" end="00:07:48.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not asking for money.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.675" end="00:07:50.995" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.795" end="00:07:53.295" style="s2">I really</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.995" end="00:07:54.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The phone slipped from my hand</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.295" end="00:07:55.995" style="s2">and I reached for it with the last</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.995" end="00:07:58.095" style="s2">strength I had.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.995" end="00:07:58.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s pregnant. She&#39;s bleeding. Call an</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.095" end="00:08:00.995" style="s2">ambulance.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.795" end="00:08:02.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian&#39;s voice finally changed.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.995" end="00:08:04.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora, where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.695" end="00:08:06.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Madeleine&#39;s voice cut in from</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.295" end="00:08:07.295" style="s2">beside him.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.095" end="00:08:09.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian,</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.295" end="00:08:11.297" style="s2">don&#39;t let her fool you again. My friend</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.397" end="00:08:12.497" style="s2">at the hospital just sent me her checkup</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.297" end="00:08:14.697" style="s2">report.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.497" end="00:08:16.297" style="s2">The fetal heartbeat was stable.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.697" end="00:08:17.497" style="s2">She isn&#39;t as serious as she wants you to</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.297" end="00:08:19.297" style="s2">think</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.497" end="00:08:20.597" style="s2">at this point.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.297" end="00:08:23.797" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t put it past her to have</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.597" end="00:08:27.397" style="s2">someone help her stage this</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.797" end="00:08:27.397" style="s2">just to make you leave me in public.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.497" end="00:08:32.397" style="s2">The line went quiet for a few seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.497" end="00:08:33.797" style="s2">When Adrian spoke again, his voice was</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.397" end="00:08:37.197" style="s2">colder than before.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.797" end="00:08:40.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora, you are beyond saving.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.197" end="00:08:41.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian Hayes sent me $100. The note read</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.297" end="00:08:43.897" style="s2">emergency fee.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.997" end="00:08:46.997" style="s2">I stared at the screen. My vision was</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.897" end="00:08:46.997" style="s2">fading at the edges.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.097" end="00:08:54.297" style="s2">When I woke up, there was an IV in the</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.897" end="00:08:56.597" style="s2">back of my hand and the sharp smell of</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.297" end="00:08:58.397" style="s2">disinfectant in my nose.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.597" end="00:09:01.697" style="s2">A nurse pressed a hand to my shoulder.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.397" end="00:09:03.697" style="s2">Nora, don&#39;t move. You just had surgery.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.697" end="00:09:05.797" style="s2">The doctor came in soon after, holding a</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.697" end="00:09:08.197" style="s2">chart. My fingers tightened around the</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.797" end="00:09:08.197" style="s2">sheet.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.697" end="00:09:12.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The baby?</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.897" end="00:09:17.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The doctor was silent for 1 second.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.297" end="00:09:19.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.497" end="00:09:21.697" style="s2">We couldn&#39;t save him.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.297" end="00:09:23.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The words struck so hard</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.697" end="00:09:25.197" style="s2">that everything around me seemed to go</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.197" end="00:09:26.897" style="s2">distant. I had felt him move that</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.197" end="00:09:28.297" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.897" end="00:09:30.197" style="s2">He had still been there when I signed</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.297" end="00:09:32.097" style="s2">the discharge form, still there on the</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.197" end="00:09:35.297" style="s2">way to the reception, still there when</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.097" end="00:09:38.297" style="s2">he gave one soft kick under my palm.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.297" end="00:09:38.297" style="s2">How could he be gone?</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.397" end="00:09:42.297" style="s2">The doctor continued. You were brought</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.297" end="00:09:44.097" style="s2">in with a severe placental abruption and</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.297" end="00:09:46.497" style="s2">heavy bleeding. We performed the</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.097" end="00:09:48.097" style="s2">C-section immediately, and the NICU team</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.497" end="00:09:50.697" style="s2">tried to resuscitate him, but he had</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.097" end="00:09:52.997" style="s2">been deprived of oxygen for too long.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.697" end="00:09:55.197" style="s2">His heart rate never recovered.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.997" end="00:09:57.497" style="s2">I opened my mouth, but no sound came</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.197" end="00:09:58.997" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.497" end="00:10:01.497" style="s2">The nurse wiped the tears from the</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.997" end="00:10:03.997" style="s2">corner of my eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.497" end="00:10:07.097" style="s2">It was a boy.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.997" end="00:10:07.097" style="s2">She said softly.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.397" end="00:10:12.698" style="s2">I had not even named him yet.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.397" end="00:10:13.898" style="s2">I had not let Adrian hear his heartbeat</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.698" end="00:10:15.498" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.898" end="00:10:18.198" style="s2">I&#39;ve imagined what he looked like</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.498" end="00:10:20.998" style="s2">countless times in my mind, whether as a</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.198" end="00:10:23.098" style="s2">boy or a girl. I loved my child deeply,</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.998" end="00:10:25.498" style="s2">yet he simply vanished, disappearing</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.098" end="00:10:27.698" style="s2">from my life forever. I am no longer his</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.498" end="00:10:29.698" style="s2">mother. He has left me forever. I</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.698" end="00:10:32.498" style="s2">remained immersed in a state of profound</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.698" end="00:10:34.998" style="s2">grief for an extended period,</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.498" end="00:10:36.898" style="s2">unable to regain my composure and could</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.998" end="00:10:39.598" style="s2">not even clearly hear what the physician</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.898" end="00:10:39.598" style="s2">said next.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.698" end="00:10:45.498" style="s2">A light knock came at the door. A</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.598" end="00:10:48.098" style="s2">hospital registry stepped in with a</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.498" end="00:10:49.098" style="s2">tablet, looking uneasy.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.098" end="00:10:50.998" style="s2">Mrs. Hayes, [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.098" end="00:10:52.398" style="s2">I&#39;m very sorry to disturb you right now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.998" end="00:10:54.398" style="s2">We need to confirm a guarantee for the</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.398" end="00:10:56.198" style="s2">remaining charges. Your surgery and</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.398" end="00:10:58.398" style="s2">emergency care have already generated</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.198" end="00:11:00.298" style="s2">some out-of-pocket expenses, and if we</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.398" end="00:11:02.498" style="s2">can reach your husband I looked at her</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.298" end="00:11:05.198" style="s2">for a long time before I understood what</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.498" end="00:11:08.998" style="s2">she was saying.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.198" end="00:11:08.998" style="s2">With the last of my strength, I said,</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.198" end="00:11:13.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call him.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.382" end="00:11:13.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.598" end="00:11:19.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The nurse picked up my phone and dialed</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.298" end="00:11:19.198" style="s2">Adrian again.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.898" end="00:11:24.498" style="s2">It still went to voicemail.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.098" end="00:11:27.598" style="s2">She glanced at me and said quietly, his</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.498" end="00:11:27.598" style="s2">phone is still off.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.898" end="00:11:34.198" style="s2">I wanted to tell her to keep calling.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.698" end="00:11:36.598" style="s2">I wanted her to tell Adrian that our</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.198" end="00:11:38.398" style="s2">child was gone.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.598" end="00:11:40.898" style="s2">I wanted to ask whether he could finally</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.398" end="00:11:40.898" style="s2">come now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.898" end="00:11:46.898" style="s2">But the next wave of pain came first.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.498" end="00:11:48.898" style="s2">Through the monitor began to shriek.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.898" end="00:11:50.398" style="s2">The nurse&#39;s face changed.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.898" end="00:11:52.698" style="s2">She hit the call button.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.398" end="00:11:54.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Postpartum hemorrhage</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.698" end="00:11:54.698" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.298" end="00:12:02.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone called out my blood pressure and</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.098" end="00:12:04.498" style="s2">the blood loss.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.698" end="00:12:05.998" style="s2">The doctor leaned over me, saying my</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.498" end="00:12:08.798" style="s2">name, telling me not to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.998" end="00:12:10.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Hayes, please persevere. We will do</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.798" end="00:12:12.499" style="s2">our utmost to save you. Do not</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.498" end="00:12:15.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched her lips move, but her voice</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.499" end="00:12:15.999" style="s2">kept drifting farther away.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.399" end="00:12:21.399" style="s2">They pushed me back toward the operating</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.299" end="00:12:23.799" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.399" end="00:12:26.499" style="s2">White ceiling light slid past above me,</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.799" end="00:12:26.499" style="s2">cold as snow.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.708" end="00:12:28.728" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.399" end="00:12:33.999" style="s2">I thought of Adrian once telling me he</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.099" end="00:12:37.199" style="s2">would stand beside me through every hard</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.999" end="00:12:37.199" style="s2">thing life could bring.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.399" end="00:12:42.699" style="s2">But at the hardest moment of my life,</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.699" end="00:12:44.499" style="s2">his phone was still unreachable.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.699" end="00:12:46.499" style="s2">The last thing I heard was the doctor</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.499" end="00:12:49.099" style="s2">saying,</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.499" end="00:12:50.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s losing blood too fast.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.099" end="00:12:53.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.199" end="00:12:53.399" style="s2">everything went dark.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.499" end="00:12:59.099" style="s2">I opened my eyes, but I was no longer in</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.999" end="00:13:01.199" style="s2">my body.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.099" end="00:13:03.199" style="s2">I looked down and saw myself lying on</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.199" end="00:13:05.299" style="s2">the operating table. The doctors were</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.199" end="00:13:08.899" style="s2">still working on me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.299" end="00:13:11.299" style="s2">But I felt nothing, no pain, no fear,</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.899" end="00:13:13.599" style="s2">just a strange lightness. I floated</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.299" end="00:13:18.199" style="s2">upward through the ceiling, through the</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.599" end="00:13:18.199" style="s2">roof. I found myself at the art museum.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.699" end="00:13:24.899" style="s2">The charity gala was still going on.</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.099" end="00:13:29.099" style="s2">There was Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.099" end="00:13:31.099" style="s2">He was standing in his dress uniform</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.099" end="00:13:33.499" style="s2">talking to Madeline.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.099" end="00:13:36.999" style="s2">I watched him from above.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.499" end="00:13:39.599" style="s2">He looked so confident, so composed.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.999" end="00:13:41.599" style="s2">He didn&#39;t know I was dead,</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.599" end="00:13:44.799" style="s2">nor did he know that our son had also</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.599" end="00:13:47.699" style="s2">died. Madeline was smiling at him. She</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.799" end="00:13:47.699" style="s2">touched his arm.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.799" end="00:13:51.899" style="s2">I wanted to scream at him.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.499" end="00:13:53.799" style="s2">I wanted to tell him to look at his</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.899" end="00:13:57.099" style="s2">phone.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.799" end="00:13:58.699" style="s2">But my voice made no sound.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.099" end="00:14:01.199" style="s2">I was just a ghost watching from the</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.699" end="00:14:03.299" style="s2">shadows.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.199" end="00:14:06.299" style="s2">The auction ended.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.299" end="00:14:08.799" style="s2">Adrian finally pulled out his phone.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.299" end="00:14:11.099" style="s2">He powered it on. I saw his face change</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.799" end="00:14:14.299" style="s2">as the missed calls appeared. 17 missed</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.099" end="00:14:15.701" style="s2">calls from the hospital, from me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.299" end="00:14:17.701" style="s2">Then I saw Cole running toward him, his</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.701" end="00:14:19.901" style="s2">face white.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.701" end="00:14:22.001" style="s2">I knew what Cole was going to say.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:24.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Major Hayes,</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.001" end="00:14:26.301" style="s2">your wife and your child are both dead.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.001" end="00:14:30.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian&#39;s face went blank. His phone</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.301" end="00:14:30.201" style="s2">slipped from his hand and hit the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.001" end="00:14:35.201" style="s2">I watched him stand there, frozen, as</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.401" end="00:14:38.301" style="s2">the word sank in.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.201" end="00:14:38.301" style="s2">I felt nothing for him.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.401" end="00:14:42.601" style="s2">No pity,</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.101" end="00:14:44.701" style="s2">no forgiveness,</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.601" end="00:14:47.101" style="s2">just emptiness. He chose to trust</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.701" end="00:14:50.401" style="s2">Madeline rather than me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.101" end="00:14:53.501" style="s2">He decided to turn off his phone.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.401" end="00:14:57.301" style="s2">Now he was living with the consequence.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.501" end="00:14:57.301" style="s2">I followed Adrian to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.201" end="00:15:04.001" style="s2">I stayed beside him in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.601" end="00:15:06.101" style="s2">He stared out the window.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.001" end="00:15:07.901" style="s2">His hands were shaking.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.101" end="00:15:09.001" style="s2">He was replaying the phone call in his</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.901" end="00:15:11.001" style="s2">head.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.001" end="00:15:12.425" style="s2">I could see it in his eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.001" end="00:15:13.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t true.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.425" end="00:15:14.501" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.080" end="00:15:16.101" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.501" end="00:15:18.301" style="s2">Nora called me, and I definitely</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.101" end="00:15:20.285" style="s2">transferred the money to her.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.301" end="00:15:21.101" style="s2">NO!</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.285" end="00:15:22.801" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.101" end="00:15:24.601" style="s2">THAT&#39;S NOT TRUE.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.801" end="00:15:26.201" style="s2">SHE WAS JUST joking</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.601" end="00:15:28.701" style="s2">with me, complaining that I don&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.201" end="00:15:28.701" style="s2">about her.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.110" end="00:15:32.130" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.201" end="00:15:38.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.901" end="00:15:39.701" style="s2">He got out and ran into the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.401" end="00:15:42.601" style="s2">The doctor was waiting outside the</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.701" end="00:15:43.701" style="s2">obstetrical unit.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.601" end="00:15:45.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is my wife?</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.701" end="00:15:47.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian asked.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.901" end="00:15:50.001" style="s2">His voice was raw.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.801" end="00:15:51.401" style="s2">The doctor was silent for a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.001" end="00:15:52.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She and the baby are in the holding</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.401" end="00:15:54.101" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.801" end="00:15:57.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora was brought in with severe</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.101" end="00:15:59.301" style="s2">placental abtraction</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.301" end="00:16:01.901" style="s2">and heavy bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.301" end="00:16:03.901" style="s2">We performed an emergency C-section, but</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.901" end="00:16:05.001" style="s2">the baby had been deprived of oxygen too</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.901" end="00:16:07.301" style="s2">long.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.001" end="00:16:10.301" style="s2">Nora hemorrhaged afterwards.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.301" end="00:16:10.301" style="s2">We could not save her.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.401" end="00:16:16.401" style="s2">I watched Adrian&#39;s throat tighten.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.301" end="00:16:18.201" style="s2">I watched him struggle to breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.401" end="00:16:19.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She called me</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.201" end="00:16:21.102" style="s2">more than once.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.502" end="00:16:23.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before surgery, she kept asking the</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.102" end="00:16:25.402" style="s2">nurses to call you. She said if only one</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.702" end="00:16:28.302" style="s2">of them could be saved, we should save</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.402" end="00:16:28.302" style="s2">the baby first.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.402" end="00:16:31.802" style="s2">I heard the doctor&#39;s words.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.402" end="00:16:35.102" style="s2">They were true.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.802" end="00:16:37.602" style="s2">I watched Adrian stand there, broken.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.102" end="00:16:39.602" style="s2">I wanted to feel sorry for him,</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.602" end="00:16:41.202" style="s2">but I couldn&#39;t. He had done this to</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.602" end="00:16:43.102" style="s2">himself.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.202" end="00:16:44.502" style="s2">A nurse placed a clear bag on the</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.102" end="00:16:46.702" style="s2">counter.</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.502" end="00:16:49.502" style="s2">Inside were my phone,</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.702" end="00:16:52.102" style="s2">my wallet, my hospital papers,</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.502" end="00:16:54.502" style="s2">and a tiny hospital bracelet. The label</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.102" end="00:16:57.502" style="s2">read Baby Hayes. I looked at that</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.502" end="00:16:59.702" style="s2">bracelet. I had never held my son.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.502" end="00:17:02.302" style="s2">Adrian picked up my phone. The screen</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.702" end="00:17:05.002" style="s2">was still open to our conversation.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.302" end="00:17:08.602" style="s2">My last message read, I&#39;m bleeding. I</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.002" end="00:17:13.302" style="s2">need the ER. Below it was his transfer.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.602" end="00:17:13.302" style="s2">Adrian Hayes sent you $100.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.702" end="00:17:17.602" style="s2">I watched him scroll upward. He stopped</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.102" end="00:17:20.102" style="s2">at the call from after I had left the</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.602" end="00:17:20.102" style="s2">hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.902" end="00:17:25.002" style="s2">He remembered what I had said. The</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.602" end="00:17:27.102" style="s2">hospital had told me to go and watch</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.002" end="00:17:28.902" style="s2">myself. He did not need to come. He</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.102" end="00:17:31.402" style="s2">didn&#39;t need to send money. He had</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.902" end="00:17:33.202" style="s2">answered with $100.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.402" end="00:17:34.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m ashamed our child has a liar for a</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.202" end="00:17:36.102" style="s2">mother.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.402" end="00:17:38.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Farther up was the voice message from my</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.102" end="00:17:38.602" style="s2">checkup.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.002" end="00:17:44.002" style="s2">The doctor says the baby may come early.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.302" end="00:17:46.302" style="s2">Can you come to the hospital?</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.002" end="00:17:47.802" style="s2">His reply had been another transfer.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.302" end="00:17:50.502" style="s2">Need money again?</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.802" end="00:17:52.802" style="s2">Adrian stared at my discharge papers.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.502" end="00:17:54.202" style="s2">High-risk pregnancy, observation</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.802" end="00:17:56.002" style="s2">recommended.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.202" end="00:17:58.102" style="s2">Bleeding or abdominal pain required</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.002" end="00:18:00.302" style="s2">immediate emergency care for every</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.102" end="00:18:02.302" style="s2">warning was real. He crushed the papers</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.302" end="00:18:03.702" style="s2">in his hand.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.302" end="00:18:05.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I see her?</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.702" end="00:18:07.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The doctor nodded and led him down the</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.402" end="00:18:07.902" style="s2">corridor.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.102" end="00:18:12.302" style="s2">I followed them.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.702" end="00:18:15.002" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know why I was still here,</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.302" end="00:18:16.302" style="s2">but I couldn&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.002" end="00:18:18.702" style="s2">The holding room was at the end of the</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.302" end="00:18:18.702" style="s2">hall.</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.802" end="00:18:27.903" style="s2">I saw my body lying under a white sheet.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.203" end="00:18:29.803" style="s2">My face was almost translucent.</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.903" end="00:18:32.303" style="s2">Beside me in a small bassinet lay my</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.803" end="00:18:33.903" style="s2">baby wrapped in a pale blanket.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.303" end="00:18:36.603" style="s2">So small.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.903" end="00:18:36.603" style="s2">So still.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.103" end="00:18:44.003" style="s2">Adrian touched my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.203" end="00:18:46.803" style="s2">It was cold.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.003" end="00:18:49.403" style="s2">I felt nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.803" end="00:18:51.203" style="s2">His phone vibrated.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.403" end="00:18:53.203" style="s2">Madeline had sent a message.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.203" end="00:18:55.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, where did you go? Everyone is</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.203" end="00:18:59.103" style="s2">worried. Let me come to you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.503" end="00:18:59.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He did not reply to Madeline.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.603" end="00:19:03.903" style="s2">I watched him look from her message to</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.203" end="00:19:06.003" style="s2">the 77 voice recordings on my phone. He</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.903" end="00:19:07.903" style="s2">had never listened to them. He had never</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.003" end="00:19:10.803" style="s2">given me that chance. He played the</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.903" end="00:19:12.703" style="s2">first one. My voice was soft.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.803" end="00:19:14.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, the doctor said the baby&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.703" end="00:19:17.103" style="s2">heartbeat is strong.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.303" end="00:19:18.503" style="s2">It sounds so fast. I know you&#39;re busy,</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.103" end="00:19:19.003" style="s2">but I really wish you could hear it</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.503" end="00:19:20.803" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.003" end="00:19:23.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The recording ended. No request for</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.803" end="00:19:25.803" style="s2">money, no accusation, only me trying to</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.803" end="00:19:28.203" style="s2">let him hear our child&#39;s heartbeat.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.803" end="00:19:31.103" style="s2">Cole stood at the door, his eyes red.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.203" end="00:19:34.103" style="s2">Adrian did not play the next message.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.103" end="00:19:35.703" style="s2">He already understood enough.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.103" end="00:19:38.003" style="s2">He closed his hand around the tiny</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.703" end="00:19:40.003" style="s2">bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.003" end="00:19:41.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole,</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.003" end="00:19:43.803" style="s2">pull everything. Hospital records,</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.803" end="00:19:45.703" style="s2">prenatal records, payment logs, login</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.803" end="00:19:48.103" style="s2">devices, transfer history, deleted</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.703" end="00:19:50.203" style="s2">messages, deleted voice recordings.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.103" end="00:19:51.503" style="s2">And Madeline,</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.203" end="00:19:53.703" style="s2">start with her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.503" end="00:19:56.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched him give the order. It was too</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.703" end="00:19:57.303" style="s2">late for me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.003" end="00:19:58.603" style="s2">But maybe it wasn&#39;t too late for the</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.303" end="00:20:00.403" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.603" end="00:20:02.403" style="s2">Not that it mattered anymore. I was</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.403" end="00:20:04.803" style="s2">already dead. Cole brought the first set</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.403" end="00:20:06.803" style="s2">of records before dawn. Adrian was still</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.803" end="00:20:08.603" style="s2">outside the holding room. My phone, my</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.803" end="00:20:10.203" style="s2">discharge papers, and the tiny hospital</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.603" end="00:20:12.103" style="s2">bracelet lay on the chair beside him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.203" end="00:20:13.903" style="s2">Cole handed him a folder.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.103" end="00:20:15.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Major Hayes, the emergent visit for</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.903" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">Nora&#39;s mother was real. The hospital</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.803" end="00:20:20.003" style="s2">records are complete.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:21.103" style="s2">$50,000 paid directly from your account</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.003" end="00:20:24.305" style="s2">to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.103" end="00:20:27.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian opened the file. patient name,</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.305" end="00:20:28.405" style="s2">surgical notice, deposit amount, payment</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.005" end="00:20:30.005" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.405" end="00:20:30.505" style="s2">Cole placed another page in front of</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.005" end="00:20:31.605" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.505" end="00:20:33.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before that payment went through,</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.605" end="00:20:34.905" style="s2">Madeleine sent Nora this.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.505" end="00:20:36.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madeleine Shaw,</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.905" end="00:20:38.905" style="s2">if your mother really needs surgery, go</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.905" end="00:20:41.405" style="s2">to the Meridian Hotel and ask for Harden</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.905" end="00:20:43.605" style="s2">Price. He helps military families. Do</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.405" end="00:20:45.305" style="s2">not tell Adrian. He will only think you</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.605" end="00:20:47.805" style="s2">embarrassed him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.305" end="00:20:50.805" style="s2">I remembered going to that hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.805" end="00:20:53.105" style="s2">I remembered that man grabbing my wrist.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.805" end="00:20:55.405" style="s2">Adrian&#39;s eyes stayed on the message. His</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.105" end="00:20:57.805" style="s2">jaw tightened. Cole continued.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.405" end="00:20:59.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Price is a retired defense contractor</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.805" end="00:21:01.605" style="s2">with several military family charities.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.805" end="00:21:03.505" style="s2">The hotel footage shows Nora meeting him</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.605" end="00:21:05.105" style="s2">in the public lounge. She never went to</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.505" end="00:21:06.705" style="s2">a suite. When he grabbed her wrist and</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.105" end="00:21:07.905" style="s2">tried to lead her toward the elevators,</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.705" end="00:21:09.205" style="s2">she pulled away.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.905" end="00:21:10.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Madeleine called me there.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.205" end="00:21:12.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian said.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.305" end="00:21:14.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, but she only told you Nora was</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.705" end="00:21:15.305" style="s2">meeting a wealthy man at a hotel to talk</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.605" end="00:21:16.905" style="s2">about money.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.305" end="00:21:19.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pieces settled into place with</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.905" end="00:21:22.505" style="s2">brutal clarity.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.505" end="00:21:24.605" style="s2">I had brought him the bill first.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.505" end="00:21:26.605" style="s2">He had refused to listen.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.605" end="00:21:28.405" style="s2">Madeleine had sent me to Price, then</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.605" end="00:21:30.505" style="s2">sent Adrian to part of the scene that</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.405" end="00:21:33.705" style="s2">would hurt most. Adrian had arrived</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.505" end="00:21:35.705" style="s2">ready to believe the worst, and he had.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.705" end="00:21:37.705" style="s2">Cole turned to the next report.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.705" end="00:21:39.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The $100 transfers did not all come from</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.705" end="00:21:40.605" style="s2">your phone.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.305" end="00:21:42.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian looked up.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.605" end="00:21:44.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some came from your main device.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.805" end="00:21:46.105" style="s2">Others came from a saved tablet logged</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.505" end="00:21:47.905" style="s2">into your payment account.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.105" end="00:21:49.605" style="s2">The tablet belongs to Madeleine.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.905" end="00:21:52.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole slid the access log across the</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.605" end="00:21:54.405" style="s2">table. Several transfers after prenatal</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.005" end="00:21:56.805" style="s2">messes had come from Madeleine&#39;s tablet.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.405" end="00:21:58.905" style="s2">A few voice messages about the heartbeat</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.805" end="00:22:01.205" style="s2">and fetal movement had been marked as</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.905" end="00:22:03.405" style="s2">played from that device.</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.205" end="00:22:05.905" style="s2">Some message previews were deleted</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.405" end="00:22:07.505" style="s2">before they reached Adrian&#39;s phone.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.905" end="00:22:10.105" style="s2">But the transfer after my mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.505" end="00:22:11.905" style="s2">funeral, the one after my car accident,</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.105" end="00:22:14.205" style="s2">and the final emergency fee had come</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.905" end="00:22:17.105" style="s2">from Adrian&#39;s own phone.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.205" end="00:22:20.005" style="s2">Madeleine had not made him innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.105" end="00:22:23.705" style="s2">She had only made his cruelty easier. I</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.005" end="00:22:26.405" style="s2">watched his face as he read the report.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.705" end="00:22:26.906" style="s2">Cole&#39;s voice lowered.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.405" end="00:22:28.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She also</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.906" end="00:22:30.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; sent edited screenshots of the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.806" end="00:22:33.306" style="s2">bill to your parents and several</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.806" end="00:22:35.606" style="s2">officers wives. She removed the medical</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.306" end="00:22:36.806" style="s2">notes and left only the amount that</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.606" end="00:22:39.506" style="s2">appears to be where the gold digger</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.806" end="00:22:39.506" style="s2">rumor started.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.606" end="00:22:43.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barracks gold digger.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.406" end="00:22:46.106" style="s2">Officer Hunter, the woman who married a</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.506" end="00:22:48.306" style="s2">major for his paycheck. Adrian had heard</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.106" end="00:22:49.606" style="s2">those names for years. He had let them</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.306" end="00:22:52.306" style="s2">stand.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.606" end="00:22:54.106" style="s2">Sometimes in anger he had smiled. I</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.306" end="00:22:57.506" style="s2">remembered those smiles. They had cut</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.106" end="00:22:57.506" style="s2">deeper than any of the whispers.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.206" end="00:23:01.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did she keep access?</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.006" end="00:23:02.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian asked.</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.306" end="00:23:04.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You authorized her for a charity event</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.906" end="00:23:06.606" style="s2">payments</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.106" end="00:23:08.406" style="s2">and military family donation work.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.606" end="00:23:10.506" style="s2">She kept a logged in device and likely</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.406" end="00:23:13.006" style="s2">had access to message previews.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.506" end="00:23:15.206" style="s2">Tech forensics will confirm the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.006" end="00:23:17.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian closed the forwarded.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.206" end="00:23:17.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is she?</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.506" end="00:23:24.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the guest residence near the museum.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.006" end="00:23:28.206" style="s2">Bay Security is watching her,</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.906" end="00:23:28.206" style="s2">but she has not been approached.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.406" end="00:23:32.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian stood.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.606" end="00:23:34.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back up everything. Hospital records,</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.906" end="00:23:37.106" style="s2">payment logs, Meridian footage,</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.606" end="00:23:38.506" style="s2">recovered messages, device access, send</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.106" end="00:23:41.106" style="s2">copies to command legal and Bay</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.506" end="00:23:43.606" style="s2">Security. Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.106" end="00:23:45.806" style="s2">Get statements</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.606" end="00:23:46.606" style="s2">from the Meridian guard and Price&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.806" end="00:23:48.606" style="s2">assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.606" end="00:23:50.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole nodded.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.606" end="00:23:52.906" style="s2">Adrian picked up my phone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.606" end="00:23:54.306" style="s2">77 voice recordings still waited on the</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.906" end="00:23:56.906" style="s2">screen.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.306" end="00:23:59.506" style="s2">He did not play them.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.906" end="00:23:59.506" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.106" end="00:24:03.606" style="s2">His own phone lit up again. Adrian,</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.106" end="00:24:05.006" style="s2">where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.606" end="00:24:08.006" style="s2">I am worried.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.006" end="00:24:08.006" style="s2">Let me come to you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.206" end="00:24:11.806" style="s2">Adrian turned the screen off.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.406" end="00:24:17.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.606" end="00:24:19.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole followed him.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.906" end="00:24:22.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.206" end="00:24:23.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian walked toward the exit.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.306" end="00:24:25.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madeleine.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.306" end="00:24:28.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I followed them.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.806" end="00:24:30.107" style="s2">I wanted to see this.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.306" end="00:24:32.107" style="s2">I want to know how that woman who ruined</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.107" end="00:24:33.507" style="s2">my life would react to everything she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.107" end="00:24:37.107" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.507" end="00:24:37.107" style="s2">But I knew it wouldn&#39;t bring me back.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.207" end="00:24:41.408" style="s2">It wouldn&#39;t bring my son back.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.007" end="00:24:43.408" style="s2">Madeleine opened the door still wearing</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.408" end="00:24:45.207" style="s2">her gala gown, a pale robe draped over</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.408" end="00:24:46.707" style="s2">her shoulders. The charity award sat on</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.207" end="00:24:49.107" style="s2">the coffee table beside the flowers and</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.707" end="00:24:50.908" style="s2">Adrian&#39;s spare charger. Adrian. She</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.107" end="00:24:53.707" style="s2">reached for him. What happened at the</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.908" end="00:24:55.707" style="s2">hospital? Adrian walked past her. Cole</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.707" end="00:24:57.607" style="s2">followed and closed the door.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.707" end="00:24:59.207" style="s2">Adrian placed the access records and</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.607" end="00:25:01.908" style="s2">payment logs on the table.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.207" end="00:25:01.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.207" end="00:25:06.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madeleine looked down.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.607" end="00:25:09.307" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what those are.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.807" end="00:25:10.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $100 transfers from your tablet.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.307" end="00:25:12.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian said.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.507" end="00:25:14.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A message preview deleted after Nora</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.507" end="00:25:16.207" style="s2">said she was bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.707" end="00:25:17.207" style="s2">Voice messages marked as played from</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.207" end="00:25:19.408" style="s2">your device.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.207" end="00:25:22.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her expression shifted.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.408" end="00:25:24.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave me access for charity work,</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.207" end="00:25:27.107" style="s2">donations, reimbursements, event</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.807" end="00:25:28.207" style="s2">payments. Maybe the device stayed logged</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.107" end="00:25:30.207" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.207" end="00:25:32.607" style="s2">You accidentally sent emergency fee to a</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.207" end="00:25:34.507" style="s2">pregnant woman who was bleeding?</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.607" end="00:25:36.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She said nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.507" end="00:25:38.607" style="s2">Cole opened the laptop. The Meridian</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.607" end="00:25:40.007" style="s2">Hotel footage showed Harland Price</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.607" end="00:25:41.908" style="s2">gripping my wrist near the lounge</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.007" end="00:25:43.307" style="s2">elevators. Adrian placed the recovered</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.908" end="00:25:45.207" style="s2">message beside it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.307" end="00:25:46.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If your mother really needs surgery, go</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.207" end="00:25:48.607" style="s2">to the Meridian Hotel and ask for</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.807" end="00:25:51.507" style="s2">Harland Price. He helps military</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.607" end="00:25:53.607" style="s2">families. Do not tell Adrian. He will</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.507" end="00:25:54.707" style="s2">only think you embarrassed him.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.607" end="00:25:56.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another [snorts] accident?</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.707" end="00:25:58.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian asked. Madeleine stared at the</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.707" end="00:26:00.207" style="s2">screen. When she spoke again, the</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.807" end="00:26:02.107" style="s2">softness was gone.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.207" end="00:26:03.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She needed money. I gave HER SOMEWHERE</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.107" end="00:26:04.507" style="s2">TO GET IT.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.207" end="00:26:06.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU KNEW what Price was.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.507" end="00:26:08.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew he had money. I knew he liked</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.707" end="00:26:10.007" style="s2">desperate women.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.307" end="00:26:11.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her eyes reddened.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.007" end="00:26:13.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But she went, didn&#39;t she? If she was</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.908" end="00:26:15.908" style="s2">innocent, why meet him at a hotel?</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.707" end="00:26:17.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I refused to listen to her.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.908" end="00:26:20.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.707" end="00:26:21.707" style="s2">Madeleine lifted her chin. You refused.</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.307" end="00:26:23.507" style="s2">I only showed you what you already</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.707" end="00:26:24.507" style="s2">wanted to believe. Madeleine stepped</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.507" end="00:26:26.908" style="s2">closer.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.507" end="00:26:29.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you want to blame me? Did I send</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.908" end="00:26:31.609" style="s2">every cent, her mother&#39;s funeral, the</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.107" end="00:26:32.909" style="s2">car accident, tonight&#39;s emergency fee?</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.609" end="00:26:34.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.909" end="00:26:36.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hated her, too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.109" end="00:26:38.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard people call her a gold digger</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.009" end="00:26:40.709" style="s2">and let them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.109" end="00:26:42.609" style="s2">You were ashamed you had chosen her.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.709" end="00:26:44.909" style="s2">You needed a reason to hate her, and I</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.609" end="00:26:47.009" style="s2">gave you one. That was the first honest</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.909" end="00:26:49.209" style="s2">thing she had said.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.009" end="00:26:51.709" style="s2">Adrian&#39;s voice was rough.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.209" end="00:26:51.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.809" end="00:26:55.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madeleine froze.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.509" end="00:26:57.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not here to make myself clean.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.709" end="00:26:59.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He handed the file to Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.209" end="00:27:00.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to turn in what you did.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.009" end="00:27:02.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole took it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.709" end="00:27:04.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send everything to Command Legal and</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.309" end="00:27:06.409" style="s2">Base Security. Device access, payment</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.509" end="00:27:08.209" style="s2">logs, deleted Meridian footage, prices</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.409" end="00:27:10.313" style="s2">records, all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.209" end="00:27:11.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madeleine went pale.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.313" end="00:27:12.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.109" end="00:27:15.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian,</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.709" end="00:27:16.809" style="s2">this will destroy me, my family.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.109" end="00:27:18.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you think about families when you</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.809" end="00:27:22.609" style="s2">went after mine?</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.409" end="00:27:25.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She reached for him. He stepped back.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.609" end="00:27:27.409" style="s2">A knock came at the door.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.409" end="00:27:29.109" style="s2">Cole opened it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.409" end="00:27:31.809" style="s2">Two Base Security officers stood</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.109" end="00:27:33.509" style="s2">outside. One of them showed the order.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.809" end="00:27:34.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madeleine Shaw, Command Legal has</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.509" end="00:27:36.909" style="s2">ordered preservation of your phone,</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.909" end="00:27:37.809" style="s2">tablet, and computer.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.909" end="00:27:38.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.809" end="00:27:40.209" style="s2">This is private.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.909" end="00:27:44.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her voice shook.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.209" end="00:27:44.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evidence tampering is not private.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.609" end="00:27:47.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The officer sealed her devices into</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.109" end="00:27:49.409" style="s2">evidence bags. The Charity Award was</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.909" end="00:27:51.309" style="s2">pushed aside, scraping against the glass</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.409" end="00:27:53.309" style="s2">table. I watched it all from the corner</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.309" end="00:27:55.909" style="s2">of the room. I felt nothing, not</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.309" end="00:27:57.709" style="s2">satisfaction, not relief, nothing. She</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.909" end="00:28:00.209" style="s2">was losing everything, but I was still</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.709" end="00:28:01.809" style="s2">dead. My son was still dead. Madeleine</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.209" end="00:28:04.509" style="s2">stared at him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.809" end="00:28:07.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if I did it, I didn&#39;t kill her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.509" end="00:28:07.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian looked at her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.809" end="00:28:13.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.209" end="00:28:14.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you doing this?</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.409" end="00:28:16.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you did it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.809" end="00:28:18.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her tears fell.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.509" end="00:28:20.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.309" end="00:28:22.809" style="s2">Ruining me won&#39;t bring her back.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.409" end="00:28:24.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian was silent for a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.809" end="00:28:26.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.409" end="00:28:26.709" style="s2">It won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.909" end="00:28:30.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He turned to leave. Madeleine called</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.109" end="00:28:32.709" style="s2">after him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.409" end="00:28:35.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t forget, Adrian,</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.709" end="00:28:36.710" style="s2">you were the one who hung up on her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.010" end="00:28:39.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He stopped at the door.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.710" end="00:28:39.210" style="s2">I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.110" end="00:28:44.010" style="s2">In the hallway, Cole followed him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.810" end="00:28:46.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where now, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.010" end="00:28:49.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian looked down at my phone.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.410" end="00:28:51.710" style="s2">The screen was dark, but the 77 in voice</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.110" end="00:28:53.110" style="s2">recordings still felt heavy in his hand.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.710" end="00:28:56.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.110" end="00:28:56.410" style="s2">I haven&#39;t finished listening to her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.110" end="00:29:01.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was going to listen to my voice. He</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.110" end="00:29:03.210" style="s2">was finally ready to listen, but it</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.110" end="00:29:05.310" style="s2">didn&#39;t change anything. I was still</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.210" end="00:29:07.810" style="s2">dead. By the time Adrian returned to the</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.310" end="00:29:09.210" style="s2">hospital, dawn had broken. Gray light</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.810" end="00:29:11.110" style="s2">pressed against the windows at the end</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.210" end="00:29:12.710" style="s2">of the corridor. The nurses had changed</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.110" end="00:29:14.410" style="s2">shifts, and the chaos from the night</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.710" end="00:29:16.910" style="s2">before had been folded into charts,</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.410" end="00:29:19.510" style="s2">handoff notes, and clinical language.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.910" end="00:29:21.510" style="s2">But my phone was still in his hand. 77</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.510" end="00:29:23.110" style="s2">voice messages. Not one of them should</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.510" end="00:29:24.910" style="s2">have been missed. He sat on the bench</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.110" end="00:29:27.610" style="s2">outside the holding room and played the</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.910" end="00:29:29.210" style="s2">second one. My voice was quiet with</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.610" end="00:29:30.510" style="s2">monitors and a nurse&#39;s voice in the</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.210" end="00:29:32.610" style="s2">background.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.510" end="00:29:35.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, the doctor said the baby was</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.610" end="00:29:36.710" style="s2">good today. His heartbeat is strong. If</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.510" end="00:29:37.410" style="s2">you have time, I can send you the</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.710" end="00:29:40.810" style="s2">report.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.410" end="00:29:43.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the next message, I laughed softly.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.810" end="00:29:44.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He just kicked me. The nurse said he</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.010" end="00:29:45.810" style="s2">might be stubborn later.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.710" end="00:29:47.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then another.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.810" end="00:29:49.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The due date should be around the middle</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.410" end="00:29:51.110" style="s2">of next month. The doctor said I should</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.610" end="00:29:51.610" style="s2">start preparing the hospital papers</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.110" end="00:29:53.210" style="s2">early.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.610" end="00:29:55.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There was no request for money in any of</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.210" end="00:29:57.510" style="s2">them. Again and again, I had only tried</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.310" end="00:29:59.910" style="s2">to tell him we had a child. A child who</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.510" end="00:30:02.410" style="s2">moved, had a heartbeat, resisted during</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.910" end="00:30:04.310" style="s2">scans, hurt me, frightened me, and still</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.410" end="00:30:06.010" style="s2">gave me hope. By the time Adrian reached</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.310" end="00:30:07.410" style="s2">the later messages, he stopped the</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.010" end="00:30:09.410" style="s2">recording.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.410" end="00:30:11.910" style="s2">He didn&#39;t have the courage</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.410" end="00:30:14.810" style="s2">to listen to everything at once. Each</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.910" end="00:30:17.110" style="s2">point was an opportunity I gave him.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.810" end="00:30:19.110" style="s2">Yet he turned it all down.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.110" end="00:30:21.210" style="s2">Cole stood nearby</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.110" end="00:30:24.210" style="s2">and did not rush him.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.210" end="00:30:27.210" style="s2">I watched the tears fall down his face,</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.210" end="00:30:27.210" style="s2">but I felt nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.910" end="00:30:30.910" style="s2">He was crying now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.410" end="00:30:37.812" style="s2">But where were his tears when I was</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.410" end="00:30:39.812" style="s2">alive? A hospital registry came over</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.812" end="00:30:41.412" style="s2">with the death certificates and release</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.812" end="00:30:43.512" style="s2">forms.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.412" end="00:30:46.012" style="s2">Major Hayes, the baby was never</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.512" end="00:30:48.012" style="s2">registered with a name.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.012" end="00:30:49.512" style="s2">At the moment, the record only says Baby</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.012" end="00:30:51.912" style="s2">Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.512" end="00:30:55.112" style="s2">Would you like to confirm a name now?</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.912" end="00:30:56.512" style="s2">Adrian looked at the blank line.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.112" end="00:30:57.912" style="s2">He did not know what I had wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.512" end="00:31:00.212" style="s2">name him,</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.912" end="00:31:02.012" style="s2">so he opened my phone</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.212" end="00:31:03.912" style="s2">and searched my notes.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.012" end="00:31:07.312" style="s2">There were appointment dates, payment</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.912" end="00:31:10.412" style="s2">reminders, medication instructions,</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.312" end="00:31:13.512" style="s2">and one saved list of baby names.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.412" end="00:31:15.212" style="s2">Most had only brief notes beside them.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.512" end="00:31:17.212" style="s2">Only one had a star,</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.212" end="00:31:19.512" style="s2">Ellie.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.212" end="00:31:22.712" style="s2">Adrian stared at the name.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.512" end="00:31:22.712" style="s2">At last, he said,</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.512" end="00:31:27.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eli Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.512" end="00:31:29.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This was the first time he had mentioned</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.312" end="00:31:31.012" style="s2">our son&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.112" end="00:31:32.512" style="s2">He had never known it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.012" end="00:31:34.512" style="s2">He had never asked,</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.512" end="00:31:36.912" style="s2">but I had chosen it because of him. He</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.512" end="00:31:38.512" style="s2">had mentioned it once in passing months</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.912" end="00:31:41.112" style="s2">before I got pregnant. He didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.512" end="00:31:43.012" style="s2">remember saying it, but I had remembered</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.112" end="00:31:44.712" style="s2">because it was the only time he had ever</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.012" end="00:31:46.712" style="s2">talked about our future child. The</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.712" end="00:31:48.712" style="s2">registry wrote it down, Nora Bennett</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.712" end="00:31:50.712" style="s2">Hayes, Eli Hayes. The two death</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.712" end="00:31:52.712" style="s2">certificates lay side by side, light as</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.712" end="00:31:54.612" style="s2">paper and impossible to lift. I looked</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.712" end="00:31:56.912" style="s2">at them. We were together now, my son</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.612" end="00:31:58.612" style="s2">and I, but Adrian was alone, and that</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.912" end="00:32:00.612" style="s2">was exactly what he deserved. The</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.612" end="00:32:02.212" style="s2">funeral was set for three days later.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.612" end="00:32:04.012" style="s2">Adrian arranged for us to be buried</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.212" end="00:32:06.112" style="s2">beside my mother near the quiet edge of</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.012" end="00:32:08.412" style="s2">the military family cemetery. I had gone</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.112" end="00:32:10.412" style="s2">to the hospital alone, paid alone, and</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.412" end="00:32:12.312" style="s2">come home alone too many times. He would</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.412" end="00:32:14.212" style="s2">not leave me far from the only family</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.312" end="00:32:16.812" style="s2">who had ever waited for me. It rained on</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.212" end="00:32:19.412" style="s2">the day of the funeral. Officers came,</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.812" end="00:32:21.612" style="s2">officers&#39; wives came, family readiness</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.412" end="00:32:23.612" style="s2">volunteers came, along with charity</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.612" end="00:32:25.812" style="s2">board members and people who had once</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.612" end="00:32:28.012" style="s2">whispered gold digger behind my back.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.812" end="00:32:29.912" style="s2">Many brought flowers, few dared to</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.012" end="00:32:32.412" style="s2">speak. Adrian stood at the front in</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.912" end="00:32:34.412" style="s2">dress uniform. He had worn that uniform</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.412" end="00:32:36.912" style="s2">with composure for years.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.412" end="00:32:38.612" style="s2">That day, standing before two caskets,</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.912" end="00:32:39.713" style="s2">every medal on his chest felt like an</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.612" end="00:32:41.213" style="s2">insult.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.713" end="00:32:43.913" style="s2">When the chaplain asked if he wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.213" end="00:32:45.213" style="s2">say anything, Adrian stepped forward.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.913" end="00:32:46.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will spend the rest of my life</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.213" end="00:32:48.813" style="s2">repenting for my sins.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.713" end="00:32:50.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rain tapped against the umbrellas. He</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.813" end="00:32:54.013" style="s2">looked at the small arrangement of</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.213" end="00:32:54.013" style="s2">flowers beside Eli&#39;s casket.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.413" end="00:32:58.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife asked me to save our child. I</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.813" end="00:33:00.913" style="s2">did not believe her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.713" end="00:33:02.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one moved.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.913" end="00:33:04.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hospital kept calling me before she</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.713" end="00:33:07.213" style="s2">died. My phone was off.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.813" end="00:33:09.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He turned his gaze to her casket, his</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.213" end="00:33:10.567" style="s2">voice lowering to something raw and</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.213" end="00:33:10.913" style="s2">final.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.567" end="00:33:12.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.913" end="00:33:15.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.813" end="00:33:17.513" style="s2">about everything. You were never wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.213" end="00:33:20.113" style="s2">Not about the baby, not about me, not</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.513" end="00:33:21.613" style="s2">about about any of it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.113" end="00:33:24.213" style="s2">I should have come. I should have</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.613" end="00:33:24.213" style="s2">believed you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.313" end="00:33:27.913" style="s2">I should have been there.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.013" end="00:33:29.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian swallowed hard. His knuckles</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.913" end="00:33:30.913" style="s2">pressed against the coffin, turning</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.713" end="00:33:32.613" style="s2">white with effort.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:34.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you can&#39;t hear me, but if you</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.613" end="00:33:37.013" style="s2">can, please don&#39;t wait for me. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.613" end="00:33:39.813" style="s2">look back for me. You and Eli go on. Go</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.013" end="00:33:41.113" style="s2">where I can&#39;t follow. I&#39;ll carry this.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.813" end="00:33:43.113" style="s2">That&#39;s my job now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.113" end="00:33:44.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched him from above.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.113" end="00:33:46.313" style="s2">He looked broken.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.813" end="00:33:48.213" style="s2">He stopped there.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.313" end="00:33:50.613" style="s2">No apology would be large enough in</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.213" end="00:33:54.113" style="s2">front of those caskets.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.613" end="00:33:55.813" style="s2">No confession could wake the dead.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.113" end="00:33:57.413" style="s2">After the burial, Cole handed him the</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.813" end="00:33:59.113" style="s2">preliminary findings. Madeleine&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.413" end="00:34:00.913" style="s2">devices had been sealed, and Command</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.113" end="00:34:02.213" style="s2">Legal had formally opened a review. The</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.913" end="00:34:03.613" style="s2">records showed that she had used</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.213" end="00:34:05.613" style="s2">Adrian&#39;s account access to send</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.613" end="00:34:07.913" style="s2">humiliating transfers, delete message</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.613" end="00:34:09.213" style="s2">prefutes, alter screenshots, and spread</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.913" end="00:34:11.113" style="s2">the story that I had married him for</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.213" end="00:34:12.913" style="s2">money. The Meridian Hotel footage had</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.113" end="00:34:14.413" style="s2">also been secured. Karen Price and his</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.913" end="00:34:16.313" style="s2">military family charity network were</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.413" end="00:34:17.613" style="s2">under investigation. An old plaint that</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.313" end="00:34:19.313" style="s2">had once been buried were beginning to</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.613" end="00:34:20.913" style="s2">surface. Madeleine&#39;s volunteer status</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.313" end="00:34:22.413" style="s2">was suspended. Her access to charity</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.913" end="00:34:23.813" style="s2">events and family wellness programs was</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.413" end="00:34:25.613" style="s2">revoked. Family issued a careful</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.813" end="00:34:27.213" style="s2">statement promising cooperation, saying</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.613" end="00:34:29.513" style="s2">little else. The people who had once</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.213" end="00:34:32.013" style="s2">gathered around her disappeared quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.513" end="00:34:33.913" style="s2">Photos of her with Adrian were removed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.013" end="00:34:36.213" style="s2">Comment sections were cleared.</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.913" end="00:34:37.913" style="s2">In the family readiness group chats, no</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.213" end="00:34:39.613" style="s2">one mentioned my name.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.913" end="00:34:41.414" style="s2">Adrian read the file</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.613" end="00:34:43.514" style="s2">and felt nothing like satisfaction.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.414" end="00:34:46.014" style="s2">Madeleine losing her reputation, her</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.514" end="00:34:48.614" style="s2">access, and her protection did not</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.014" end="00:34:51.114" style="s2">change the two death certificates.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.614" end="00:34:54.614" style="s2">I agreed with him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.114" end="00:34:56.614" style="s2">Nothing could change what had happened.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.614" end="00:34:57.914" style="s2">That night, he returned to base housing</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.614" end="00:34:59.814" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.914" end="00:35:02.414" style="s2">The house still held my traces. The</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.814" end="00:35:04.414" style="s2">medication sat by the bed. The old photo</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.414" end="00:35:06.414" style="s2">lay face down on the dining table. The</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.414" end="00:35:09.014" style="s2">discharged papers were folded neatly in</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.414" end="00:35:10.914" style="s2">my bag. Adrian walked to the table and</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.014" end="00:35:13.014" style="s2">turned the photo over.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.914" end="00:35:14.514" style="s2">In it, he was young and proud, holding</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.014" end="00:35:15.814" style="s2">me against his side as if he truly</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.514" end="00:35:17.414" style="s2">believed he would protect me for the</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.814" end="00:35:19.114" style="s2">rest of his life. On the back, I had</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.414" end="00:35:20.714" style="s2">written, he said I was his home. I</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.114" end="00:35:22.314" style="s2">watched him read my words. His hand</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.714" end="00:35:23.914" style="s2">trembled. He had meant it once, but he</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.314" end="00:35:25.614" style="s2">had stopped meaning it a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.914" end="00:35:27.214" style="s2">Adrian stood there for a long time. Then</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.614" end="00:35:28.414" style="s2">he placed the photo and Eli&#39;s hospital</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.214" end="00:35:30.614" style="s2">bracelet and plugged phone into the</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.414" end="00:35:33.014" style="s2">charger. When the screen lit up, the 77</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.614" end="00:35:35.714" style="s2">voice messages were still there.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.014" end="00:35:38.314" style="s2">He did not run from them this time.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.714" end="00:35:40.314" style="s2">That night, in the empty house, Adrian</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.314" end="00:35:42.914" style="s2">began listening to what I had tried to</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.314" end="00:35:42.914" style="s2">tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.314" end="00:35:49.614" style="s2">Then he started crying.</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.214" end="00:35:52.114" style="s2">Five years later, Adrian Hayes no longer</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.614" end="00:35:54.114" style="s2">wore a uniform. After the investigation</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.114" end="00:35:56.214" style="s2">ended, he left active command. The</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.114" end="00:35:57.814" style="s2">paperwork said personal reasons, but</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.214" end="00:35:59.314" style="s2">everyone who knew him understood what</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.814" end="00:36:01.414" style="s2">that meant. Madeleine never went to</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.314" end="00:36:03.314" style="s2">prison. Her family&#39;s lawyers kept her</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.414" end="00:36:05.714" style="s2">out, but the plea agreement cost her</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.314" end="00:36:08.614" style="s2">charity board seat, her military family</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.714" end="00:36:10.114" style="s2">program access, part of her trust, and</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.614" end="00:36:12.814" style="s2">the social circle that had once</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.114" end="00:36:12.814" style="s2">protected her.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.914" end="00:36:17.814" style="s2">Years later, new officers&#39; wives knew</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.214" end="00:36:20.414" style="s2">her name only as a warning.</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.814" end="00:36:22.914" style="s2">Adrian stopped following her life.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.414" end="00:36:24.514" style="s2">He sold the house near base and moved</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.914" end="00:36:27.914" style="s2">into a small apartment across from the</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.514" end="00:36:27.914" style="s2">military family cemetery.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.914" end="00:36:33.514" style="s2">Every morning before work, he stopped</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.714" end="00:36:33.514" style="s2">for coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.114" end="00:36:41.814" style="s2">At first, he brought one cup for me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.914" end="00:36:44.314" style="s2">Later, he brought two, one for me,</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.814" end="00:36:45.816" style="s2">one for Eli.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.314" end="00:36:46.916" style="s2">He was trying to up for what he had</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.816" end="00:36:49.216" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.916" end="00:36:52.116" style="s2">The headstone carried two names, Nora</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.216" end="00:36:54.516" style="s2">Bennett Hayes, Eli Hayes. Below them was</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.116" end="00:36:56.916" style="s2">one line. They waited.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.516" end="00:36:58.816" style="s2">Adrian had chosen it himself.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.916" end="00:37:02.516" style="s2">I had waited for him to answer, to</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.816" end="00:37:04.116" style="s2">believe me, to come to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.516" end="00:37:06.116" style="s2">Eli had waited for him to hear his</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.116" end="00:37:08.016" style="s2">heartbeat, to acknowledge him, to become</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.116" end="00:37:09.816" style="s2">his father in time. Neither of us had</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.016" end="00:37:12.016" style="s2">been given that.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.816" end="00:37:14.016" style="s2">And now he stood here every morning,</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.016" end="00:37:16.016" style="s2">bringing coffee to our grave. Later,</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.016" end="00:37:18.016" style="s2">Adrian founded a small emergency fund in</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.016" end="00:37:19.816" style="s2">our names. It paid hospital deposits for</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.016" end="00:37:21.416" style="s2">pregnant military spouses, arranged</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.816" end="00:37:23.116" style="s2">rides to medical appointments, screened</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.416" end="00:37:25.016" style="s2">donors, and covered temporary housing</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.116" end="00:37:26.416" style="s2">for families in crisis.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.016" end="00:37:28.916" style="s2">The board once asked him to write a</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.416" end="00:37:30.716" style="s2">founder statement. He refused. Paying</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.916" end="00:37:32.916" style="s2">strangers&#39; bills could never repay the</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.716" end="00:37:35.016" style="s2">one time he had failed me. I agreed with</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.916" end="00:37:36.116" style="s2">him. No amount of money could bring me</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.016" end="00:37:38.116" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.116" end="00:37:40.116" style="s2">Cole helped sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.116" end="00:37:42.316" style="s2">He had been promoted by then, but he</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.116" end="00:37:44.116" style="s2">never told Adrian he had done enough.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.316" end="00:37:45.816" style="s2">Neither of them believed that. My phone</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.116" end="00:37:47.716" style="s2">stayed in Adrian&#39;s bedside drawer. He</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.816" end="00:37:49.816" style="s2">changed apartments, jobs, and phone</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.716" end="00:37:53.216" style="s2">numbers, but he never replaced it. When</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.816" end="00:37:54.916" style="s2">the battery failed, he had it repaired.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.216" end="00:37:56.116" style="s2">When the screen cracked, he repaired</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.916" end="00:37:57.916" style="s2">that, too.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.116" end="00:37:59.816" style="s2">Every night before sleeping, he charged</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.916" end="00:38:01.416" style="s2">it. I watched him do this for five</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.816" end="00:38:02.816" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.416" end="00:38:05.716" style="s2">He was holding on to something that was</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.816" end="00:38:05.716" style="s2">already gone.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.516" end="00:38:11.716" style="s2">He did eventually listen to all 77 voice</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.116" end="00:38:14.316" style="s2">messages. The first year, he could not</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.716" end="00:38:16.216" style="s2">get past the 10th. The second year, he</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.316" end="00:38:17.716" style="s2">reached the one where I laughed softly</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.216" end="00:38:20.016" style="s2">and said the baby had hidden from the</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.716" end="00:38:22.116" style="s2">ultrasound probe. The third and fourth</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.016" end="00:38:23.916" style="s2">years, he listened in pieces. On the</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.116" end="00:38:25.416" style="s2">fifth anniversary of my death, he</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.916" end="00:38:26.716" style="s2">started from the first message and</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.416" end="00:38:29.216" style="s2">played them all.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.716" end="00:38:31.116" style="s2">It rained hard that night. Adrian came</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.216" end="00:38:33.516" style="s2">home from the cemetery,</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.116" end="00:38:35.416" style="s2">hung his wet coat by the door,</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.516" end="00:38:37.316" style="s2">and placed my phone on the dining table.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.416" end="00:38:39.116" style="s2">Beside it were Eli&#39;s hospital bracelet,</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.316" end="00:38:41.116" style="s2">the first ultrasound photo, and the old</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.116" end="00:38:43.016" style="s2">picture he had kept for years. My voice</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.116" end="00:38:45.416" style="s2">changed across the recordings from</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.016" end="00:38:48.117" style="s2">hopeful to careful, then tired. I</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.416" end="00:38:49.917" style="s2">watched his face as he listened.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.117" end="00:38:51.517" style="s2">I saw the tears streamed down his</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.917" end="00:38:53.517" style="s2">cheeks.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.517" end="00:38:55.617" style="s2">He was five years too late, and I</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.517" end="00:38:57.317" style="s2">couldn&#39;t forgive him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.617" end="00:38:59.317" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t forgive him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.317" end="00:39:00.517" style="s2">In the final message, I was silent for a</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.317" end="00:39:01.917" style="s2">long time.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.517" end="00:39:03.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, I don&#39;t know if you&#39;ll ever</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.917" end="00:39:05.217" style="s2">listen to these.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.417" end="00:39:07.217" style="s2">If you do, I hope you know I wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.217" end="00:39:08.817" style="s2">trying to take anything from you. I only</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.217" end="00:39:10.717" style="s2">wanted you to know him.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.817" end="00:39:12.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the recording ended, only the rain</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.717" end="00:39:14.217" style="s2">remained.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.217" end="00:39:15.917" style="s2">Adrian picked up Eli&#39;s hospital bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.217" end="00:39:17.817" style="s2">and held it in his palm. It weighed</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.917" end="00:39:20.017" style="s2">almost nothing, lighter than a coin,</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.817" end="00:39:22.017" style="s2">lighter than $100, yet it had pressed</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.017" end="00:39:23.417" style="s2">against his heart for five years, and it</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.017" end="00:39:24.517" style="s2">would stay there for the rest of his</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.417" end="00:39:26.517" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.517" end="00:39:29.317" style="s2">I wanted to feel sorry for him, but I</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.517" end="00:39:31.217" style="s2">couldn&#39;t. Near dawn, the rain stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.317" end="00:39:32.917" style="s2">Adrian went out for coffee as usual.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.217" end="00:39:34.317" style="s2">Adrian stood there for a long time. He</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.917" end="00:39:36.217" style="s2">had once thought the cruelest punishment</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.317" end="00:39:38.017" style="s2">was loss. Now he knew it was living</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.217" end="00:39:39.817" style="s2">after every missed call, every $100</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.017" end="00:39:41.517" style="s2">transfer, every word I had spoken</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.817" end="00:39:43.917" style="s2">without an answer. He wiped rain from</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.517" end="00:39:45.417" style="s2">the edge of the stone.</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.917" end="00:39:46.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They waited.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.417" end="00:39:48.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only then did he understand that the</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.917" end="00:39:50.717" style="s2">sentence had never been complete. They</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.617" end="00:39:52.617" style="s2">had waited for him, and he had not come.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.717" end="00:39:54.217" style="s2">I watched him walk away. He finally</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.617" end="00:39:57.317" style="s2">understood.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.217" end="00:39:59.417" style="s2">Adrian returned to his apartment.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.317" end="00:40:02.217" style="s2">He sat down at the table. He took out a</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.417" end="00:40:02.217" style="s2">piece of paper</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.017" end="00:40:06.917" style="s2">and began to write.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.152" end="00:40:09.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.617" end="00:40:11.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear Nora, today I helped a woman at the</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.817" end="00:40:13.517" style="s2">fund. She was pregnant and scared. She</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.917" end="00:40:15.717" style="s2">reminded me of you. I told her</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.517" end="00:40:17.017" style="s2">everything would be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.717" end="00:40:17.617" style="s2">I said the words I should have said to</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.017" end="00:40:19.617" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.617" end="00:40:21.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He stopped writing. The pen trembled in</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.617" end="00:40:23.817" style="s2">his hand. He had said those words to a</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.817" end="00:40:26.117" style="s2">stranger, but he had never said them to</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.817" end="00:40:28.117" style="s2">me. He folded the letter and placed it</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.117" end="00:40:29.817" style="s2">in the box beside my photo. He would</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.117" end="00:40:30.817" style="s2">never send it, but he would keep</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.817" end="00:40:32.117" style="s2">writing.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.817" end="00:40:33.717" style="s2">I watched him from the corner of the</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.117" end="00:40:35.517" style="s2">room. He was trying to make peace with</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.717" end="00:40:37.817" style="s2">what he had done, but he didn&#39;t deserve</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.517" end="00:40:39.817" style="s2">peace. He didn&#39;t deserve forgiveness. I</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.817" end="00:40:41.517" style="s2">had died alone in a hospital bed while</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.817" end="00:40:44.317" style="s2">he stood under chandeliers with another</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.517" end="00:40:46.817" style="s2">woman. I had lost my son. I had lost my</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.317" end="00:40:50.917" style="s2">life, and he had lost nothing but his</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.817" end="00:40:50.917" style="s2">pride. It was too little. It was too</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.018" end="00:42:04.618" style="s2">late, but I stayed. I watched. I waited.</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.518" end="00:42:05.918" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know what I was waiting for.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.618" end="00:42:06.718" style="s2">Maybe I was waiting for him to</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.918" end="00:42:08.518" style="s2">understand that he</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.718" end="00:42:10.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, I had another checkup today. The</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.518" end="00:42:11.718" style="s2">doctor said everything looks good. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.318" end="00:42:13.218" style="s2">still hoping you&#39;ll come to one of these</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.718" end="00:42:14.418" style="s2">appointments, but if you can&#39;t, I</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.218" end="00:42:17.018" style="s2">understand.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.418" end="00:42:19.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian started crying again.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.018" end="00:42:22.518" style="s2">He had helped that woman so easily.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.818" end="00:42:24.818" style="s2">Why had he made it so hard for me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.518" end="00:42:26.318" style="s2">One evening, Adrian received a letter in</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.818" end="00:42:27.918" style="s2">the mail.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.318" end="00:42:29.518" style="s2">It was from the doctor who had tried to</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.918" end="00:42:31.518" style="s2">save me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.518" end="00:42:33.618" style="s2">She was retiring and wanted to tell him</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.518" end="00:42:35.218" style="s2">something before she left.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.618" end="00:42:37.718" style="s2">Adrian opened the letter with trembling</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.218" end="00:42:37.718" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.018" end="00:42:42.618" style="s2">The doctor had written about that night.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.018" end="00:42:44.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora was conscious for a few minutes</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.618" end="00:42:46.518" style="s2">after the C-section. She asked me to</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.418" end="00:42:48.618" style="s2">tell you something. She said, if I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.518" end="00:42:49.718" style="s2">make it, please tell him the baby was</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.618" end="00:42:51.920" style="s2">loved.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.718" end="00:42:53.920" style="s2">Tell him I never stopped loving him.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.920" end="00:42:55.120" style="s2">Adrian read the words. His face</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.920" end="00:42:57.220" style="s2">crumpled.</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.120" end="00:42:59.520" style="s2">Adrian folded the letter and placed it</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.220" end="00:43:01.620" style="s2">beside my phone.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.520" end="00:43:03.320" style="s2">He had heard the words before,</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.620" end="00:43:06.020" style="s2">but hearing them from a stranger made</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.320" end="00:43:06.020" style="s2">them final.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.620" end="00:43:11.120" style="s2">Cole arrived with a new file.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.720" end="00:43:13.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the investigation into Harlan Price</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.120" end="00:43:14.920" style="s2">is complete.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.020" end="00:43:17.020" style="s2">The old complaints are surfacing.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.920" end="00:43:19.020" style="s2">Multiple victims have come forward.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.020" end="00:43:20.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian did not look up.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.020" end="00:43:22.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Madeleine?</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.720" end="00:43:24.120" style="s2">Her family&#39;s lawyers kept her out of</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.120" end="00:43:25.620" style="s2">prison, but they can&#39;t protect her from</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.120" end="00:43:27.520" style="s2">Price&#39;s trial.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.620" end="00:43:30.320" style="s2">She sent victims to him.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.520" end="00:43:33.820" style="s2">That makes her complicit.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.320" end="00:43:33.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian finally looked up.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.620" end="00:43:37.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long?</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.320" end="00:43:40.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the prosecution consolidates the</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.820" end="00:43:43.020" style="s2">cases,</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.120" end="00:43:45.220" style="s2">she could face 5 to 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.020" end="00:43:46.820" style="s2">Price is looking at 20 minimum.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.220" end="00:43:48.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian closed the file. He had been</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.820" end="00:43:50.920" style="s2">waiting for this moment for years. Every</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.920" end="00:43:52.420" style="s2">document, every witness statement, every</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.920" end="00:43:54.620" style="s2">piece of evidence had been collected</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.420" end="00:43:56.220" style="s2">with painstaking precision. He wanted</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.620" end="00:43:58.120" style="s2">more than justice.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.220" end="00:44:00.920" style="s2">He wanted them to feel what I had felt,</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.120" end="00:44:02.820" style="s2">the isolation, the desperation, the</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.920" end="00:44:07.120" style="s2">moment when no one came.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.820" end="00:44:09.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want Price in a federal courtroom.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.120" end="00:44:12.320" style="s2">I want every victim&#39;s name on the</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.120" end="00:44:15.020" style="s2">record, and I want Madeleine to testify</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.320" end="00:44:16.520" style="s2">against him. That will require a deal.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.020" end="00:44:17.920" style="s2">Give her one,</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.520" end="00:44:20.220" style="s2">but make sure she loses everything</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.920" end="00:44:24.820" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.220" end="00:44:28.020" style="s2">Reputation, access, family protection.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.820" end="00:44:28.020" style="s2">Let her sit with what she did.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.420" end="00:44:31.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole hesitated.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.020" end="00:44:33.820" style="s2">He had seen Adrian change over the</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.620" end="00:44:36.120" style="s2">years. The man who once stood tall in</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.820" end="00:44:37.420" style="s2">his uniform had become someone else,</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.120" end="00:44:39.020" style="s2">someone who carried the weight of the</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.420" end="00:44:43.120" style="s2">dead with every step.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.020" end="00:44:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, what happens after the trial?</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.220" end="00:44:46.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian looked out the window. The sky</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.520" end="00:44:48.720" style="s2">was gray.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.920" end="00:44:50.420" style="s2">The cemetery was just visible in the</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.720" end="00:44:52.120" style="s2">distance.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.420" end="00:44:54.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After the trial, I finished what I</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.120" end="00:44:56.421" style="s2">started, the fund,</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.221" end="00:44:56.421" style="s2">the work.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.121" end="00:45:00.421" style="s2">And then I come home.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.321" end="00:45:01.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole did not understand, but he nodded</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.421" end="00:45:04.021" style="s2">anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.621" end="00:45:05.721" style="s2">I understood.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.021" end="00:45:09.721" style="s2">I had been watching him long enough to</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.721" end="00:45:09.721" style="s2">know exactly what home meant to him now.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.021" end="00:45:16.721" style="s2">The trial was set for late autumn.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.121" end="00:45:20.621" style="s2">I watched from above as reporters</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.721" end="00:45:20.621" style="s2">gathered outside the federal courthouse.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.221" end="00:45:25.421" style="s2">Harlan Price arrived in handcuffs. His</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.921" end="00:45:26.921" style="s2">face was pale. His lawyers surrounded</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.421" end="00:45:28.521" style="s2">him like a shield. Behind him, Madeleine</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.921" end="00:45:30.121" style="s2">walked in with her head down. She wore a</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.521" end="00:45:31.121" style="s2">plain suit and no makeup. Her hair was</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.121" end="00:45:32.321" style="s2">flat against her head. She looked</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.121" end="00:45:33.621" style="s2">nothing like the woman who had smiled at</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.321" end="00:45:35.221" style="s2">galas and posed for photos beside</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.621" end="00:45:36.721" style="s2">Adrian. Her family was not there. Her</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.221" end="00:45:39.421" style="s2">friends were not there. No one was there</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.721" end="00:45:41.321" style="s2">for her. Adrian sat in the front row. He</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.421" end="00:45:43.221" style="s2">did not look at her. He looked only at</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.321" end="00:45:45.321" style="s2">the witness stand. The first victim</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.221" end="00:45:47.221" style="s2">testified. She told how he had grabbed</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.321" end="00:45:49.321" style="s2">her, threatened her, and made her feel</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.221" end="00:45:51.021" style="s2">like she had no way out. Her voice</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.321" end="00:45:53.621" style="s2">shook. She cried.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.021" end="00:45:57.221" style="s2">But she kept going.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.621" end="00:45:57.221" style="s2">Then another victim came forward.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.521" end="00:46:03.321" style="s2">And another.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.421" end="00:46:06.121" style="s2">Each story was the same.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.321" end="00:46:08.221" style="s2">Each story was mine.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.121" end="00:46:10.421" style="s2">Madeleine was called to the stand. The</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.221" end="00:46:12.321" style="s2">prosecutor asked her questions. She</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.421" end="00:46:13.821" style="s2">answered in a low voice.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.321" end="00:46:16.121" style="s2">She said she did not know what happened</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.821" end="00:46:18.021" style="s2">behind closed doors, but no one believed</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.121" end="00:46:19.821" style="s2">her. The prosecutor held up a document.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.021" end="00:46:21.721" style="s2">It was an email from Madeleine to Price.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.821" end="00:46:23.121" style="s2">It listed my name. It listed the date.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.721" end="00:46:24.921" style="s2">It said I was desperate and easy to</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.121" end="00:46:26.621" style="s2">manipulate. Adrian&#39;s jaw tightened. He</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.921" end="00:46:28.221" style="s2">had read that email before, but hearing</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.621" end="00:46:29.621" style="s2">it read aloud in open court made it real</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.221" end="00:46:31.421" style="s2">in a different way. When Madeleine</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.621" end="00:46:33.121" style="s2">looked at him, he looked away.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.421" end="00:46:35.521" style="s2">The verdict came on the third day,</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.121" end="00:46:37.821" style="s2">guilty on all counts. Harlan Price was</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.521" end="00:46:39.621" style="s2">sentenced to 25 years in federal prison.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.821" end="00:46:41.921" style="s2">Madeleine Shaw was sentenced to eight</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.621" end="00:46:43.821" style="s2">years for complicity.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.921" end="00:46:46.121" style="s2">I watched her cry as they led her away.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.821" end="00:46:47.921" style="s2">She looked at Adrian one last time.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.121" end="00:46:48.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did it for you. I wanted you to be</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.921" end="00:46:51.021" style="s2">happy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.921" end="00:46:52.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian did not respond.</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.021" end="00:46:54.721" style="s2">He turned and walked out of the</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.221" end="00:46:57.523" style="s2">courtroom.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.721" end="00:46:59.922" style="s2">Outside, the sun was setting.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.523" end="00:47:02.223" style="s2">The sky was orange and red.</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.922" end="00:47:04.922" style="s2">It looked like the world was burning.</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.223" end="00:47:07.723" style="s2">Cole waited by the car.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.922" end="00:47:09.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.723" end="00:47:10.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian shook his head.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.122" end="00:47:12.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.122" end="00:47:12.622" style="s2">It&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.723" end="00:47:17.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He looked at the sky.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.823" end="00:47:19.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still have to live with what I did.</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.122" end="00:47:21.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched him from above.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.422" end="00:47:23.422" style="s2">He had done everything right this time.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.723" end="00:47:25.323" style="s2">He had gathered evidence. He had brought</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.422" end="00:47:27.723" style="s2">them to justice. He had made sure the</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.323" end="00:47:29.622" style="s2">truth came out. He got into the car. The</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.723" end="00:47:31.323" style="s2">courthouse faded behind him. All that</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.622" end="00:47:33.323" style="s2">was left was the silence and the road</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.323" end="00:47:35.122" style="s2">ahead. I followed him. I had nowhere</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.323" end="00:47:36.823" style="s2">else to go. I could vaguely sense what</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.122" end="00:47:39.823" style="s2">he intended to do next, and I realized</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.823" end="00:47:39.823" style="s2">that I was about to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.223" end="00:47:46.122" style="s2">The night after the trial, Adrian</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.323" end="00:47:47.523" style="s2">returned to his apartment.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.122" end="00:47:50.023" style="s2">He sat at the table and took out my</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.523" end="00:47:50.023" style="s2">phone.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.723" end="00:47:55.422" style="s2">He scrolled through the transfers.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.823" end="00:48:00.723" style="s2">$100,</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.422" end="00:48:01.922" style="s2">$100, $100, 77 payments, 77 voice</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.723" end="00:48:03.622" style="s2">messages.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.922" end="00:48:05.823" style="s2">He had given me money,</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.622" end="00:48:08.523" style="s2">but he had never given me himself. He</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.823" end="00:48:11.723" style="s2">opened the box beside him.</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.523" end="00:48:13.622" style="s2">Inside were Eli&#39;s hospital bracelet,</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.723" end="00:48:16.723" style="s2">our wedding photo, and the letters he</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.622" end="00:48:18.922" style="s2">had written but never sent.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.723" end="00:48:20.422" style="s2">He took out a new piece of paper.</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.922" end="00:48:21.622" style="s2">He began to write.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.422" end="00:48:23.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear Nora,</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.622" end="00:48:25.323" style="s2">Today they were sentenced.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.422" end="00:48:27.122" style="s2">Price is going to prison. Madeline is</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.323" end="00:48:30.422" style="s2">going to prison. But it doesn&#39;t feel</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.122" end="00:48:32.223" style="s2">like justice. It feels like accounting.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.422" end="00:48:33.922" style="s2">Like I&#39;m checking off boxes on a list</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.223" end="00:48:35.422" style="s2">that will never be complete. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.922" end="00:48:37.622" style="s2">know why I&#39;m still writing to you. You</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.422" end="00:48:39.223" style="s2">can&#39;t read this. You can&#39;t forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.622" end="00:48:41.622" style="s2">You can&#39;t even see me. But I have to</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.223" end="00:48:43.323" style="s2">keep going for Eli, for you, for the</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.622" end="00:48:44.823" style="s2">women I try to help, for all the ones I</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.323" end="00:48:46.323" style="s2">failed before I learned to see.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.823" end="00:48:48.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He folded the letter and placed it in</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.323" end="00:48:49.023" style="s2">the box. Then he looked at Eli&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.223" end="00:48:50.323" style="s2">bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.023" end="00:48:51.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have been there. I should have</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.323" end="00:48:53.622" style="s2">been the father he deserved. I should</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.922" end="00:48:55.023" style="s2">have held him. I should have named him.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.622" end="00:48:57.023" style="s2">I should have been in that room when he</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.023" end="00:48:58.622" style="s2">took his first breath. Instead, I was</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.023" end="00:48:59.523" style="s2">standing under chandeliers with a woman</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.622" end="00:48:59.924" style="s2">who destroyed us.</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.523" end="00:49:01.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He pressed</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.924" end="00:49:03.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the bracelet to his palm. He did not</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.424" end="00:49:05.324" style="s2">cry. He was past crying. He just sat</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.424" end="00:49:07.124" style="s2">there, alone in the dark. The hours</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.324" end="00:49:08.924" style="s2">passed, the clock ticked, the world</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.124" end="00:49:10.524" style="s2">outside kept turning, but inside that</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.924" end="00:49:12.524" style="s2">apartment everything had stopped. The</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.524" end="00:49:14.724" style="s2">next morning, Adrian went to the</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.524" end="00:49:16.824" style="s2">cemetery as usual.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.724" end="00:49:20.424" style="s2">He brought two cups of coffee,</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.824" end="00:49:22.124" style="s2">one for me, one for Eli.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.424" end="00:49:24.424" style="s2">He placed them on the stone and sat</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.124" end="00:49:24.424" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.224" end="00:49:29.224" style="s2">The grass was wet with dew, the air was</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.924" end="00:49:30.524" style="s2">cold, winter was coming. Adrian sat in</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.224" end="00:49:31.524" style="s2">silence for a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.524" end="00:49:33.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know if you can hear me, but I</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.524" end="00:49:34.624" style="s2">want you to know that I&#39;m sorry. I know</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.024" end="00:49:36.024" style="s2">that&#39;s not enough. I know it will never</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.624" end="00:49:37.824" style="s2">be enough. I&#39;ve said it a thousand</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.024" end="00:49:39.324" style="s2">times. I&#39;ll say it a thousand more, and</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.824" end="00:49:42.124" style="s2">it still won&#39;t be enough.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.324" end="00:49:45.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He paused. His voice was quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.124" end="00:49:47.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think about night every day.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.124" end="00:49:48.424" style="s2">I think about the calls I didn&#39;t answer.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.124" end="00:49:49.624" style="s2">I think about the money I sent instead</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.424" end="00:49:51.024" style="s2">of showing up.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.624" end="00:49:51.924" style="s2">I think about Eli. I think about what he</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.024" end="00:49:54.224" style="s2">would have looked like, who he would</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.924" end="00:49:55.524" style="s2">have become. Would he have had my eyes,</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.224" end="00:49:56.924" style="s2">your smile?</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.524" end="00:49:57.924" style="s2">Would he have been stubborn like you?</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.924" end="00:49:59.924" style="s2">Would he have loved the rain?</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.924" end="00:50:01.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He reached out and touched the stone.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.924" end="00:50:03.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry I wasn&#39;t there. I sorry I</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.624" end="00:50:05.124" style="s2">didn&#39;t believe you. I&#39;m sorry I chose</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.224" end="00:50:05.829" style="s2">her words over yours. I&#39;m sorry for all</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.124" end="00:50:07.724" style="s2">of it,</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.829" end="00:50:09.024" style="s2">[snorts] every single moment of it. I</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.724" end="00:50:10.524" style="s2">wish I could take it back. I wish I</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.024" end="00:50:11.824" style="s2">could trade places with you, but I</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.524" end="00:50:12.924" style="s2">can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.824" end="00:50:14.324" style="s2">And that&#39;s the worst part.</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.924" end="00:50:16.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He had said these words a thousand</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.324" end="00:50:18.724" style="s2">times. They never changed anything, but</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.524" end="00:50:20.624" style="s2">this time something was different. He</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.724" end="00:50:22.024" style="s2">stood up and took a deep breath.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.624" end="00:50:23.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t keep living like this. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.024" end="00:50:25.024" style="s2">keep carrying guilt and calling it</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.424" end="00:50:26.624" style="s2">memory. I can&#39;t keep coming here every</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.024" end="00:50:28.224" style="s2">morning and pretending that coffee and</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.624" end="00:50:30.324" style="s2">apologies will fix what I broke.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.224" end="00:50:32.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He looked at the stone one last time.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.324" end="00:50:33.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to finish what I started, the</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.024" end="00:50:35.324" style="s2">fund, the work,</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.924" end="00:50:36.924" style="s2">and then I&#39;ll come back to you, not</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.324" end="00:50:37.924" style="s2">because I think it will fix anything,</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.924" end="00:50:38.524" style="s2">but because I don&#39;t know where else to</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.924" end="00:50:40.424" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.524" end="00:50:42.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew what he meant.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.424" end="00:50:44.924" style="s2">Three months passed. Adrian worked</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.324" end="00:50:46.924" style="s2">harder than ever. He expanded the fund.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.924" end="00:50:48.824" style="s2">He hired more staff. He made sure every</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.924" end="00:50:51.724" style="s2">military spouse in CS had somewhere to</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.824" end="00:50:53.124" style="s2">turn. He gave speeches. He raised money.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.724" end="00:50:55.524" style="s2">He built something that would outlast</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.124" end="00:50:57.724" style="s2">him. Cole stayed by his side.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.524" end="00:50:59.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, you&#39;ve done enough,</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.724" end="00:51:00.924" style="s2">more than enough.</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.324" end="00:51:02.524" style="s2">The fund is stable.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.924" end="00:51:04.025" style="s2">The staff is solid.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.524" end="00:51:05.225" style="s2">The board is committed.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.025" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to keep running yourself</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.225" end="00:51:08.525" style="s2">into the ground.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.125" end="00:51:10.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian looked up from his desk. His eyes</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.525" end="00:51:12.625" style="s2">were tired. His face was thin. He had</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.925" end="00:51:14.125" style="s2">not been sleeping well.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.625" end="00:51:18.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more thing.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.125" end="00:51:18.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He opened a drawer and took out a file.</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.725" end="00:51:22.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to set up a permanent scholarship</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.125" end="00:51:24.325" style="s2">for children who lose a parent in active</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.325" end="00:51:26.625" style="s2">ser Call it the Eli Hayes Memorial Fund.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.325" end="00:51:28.025" style="s2">Full tuition, room and bad, books,</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.625" end="00:51:29.225" style="s2">everything for as long as the fund</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.025" end="00:51:30.425" style="s2">exists.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.225" end="00:51:31.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a good name.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.425" end="00:51:33.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian nodded. He looked tired. He</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.925" end="00:51:35.325" style="s2">looked older than his age. The grief had</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.725" end="00:51:36.525" style="s2">carved lines into his face that no</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.325" end="00:51:38.425" style="s2">amount of rest could erase.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.525" end="00:51:40.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want it to run forever, even when I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.425" end="00:51:41.625" style="s2">gone. I want Eli&#39;s name to mean</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.125" end="00:51:44.125" style="s2">something. I want people to say it out</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.625" end="00:51:46.125" style="s2">loud. I want him to be remembered.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.125" end="00:51:47.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole hesitated. He had been with Adrian</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.125" end="00:51:47.925" style="s2">long enough to sense something was</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.325" end="00:51:49.325" style="s2">wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.925" end="00:51:50.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, are you okay? You&#39;ve been talking</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.325" end="00:51:52.125" style="s2">like this for weeks, like you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.625" end="00:51:54.125" style="s2">planning for something.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.125" end="00:51:55.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian did not answer immediately. He</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.125" end="00:51:57.625" style="s2">looked out the window. The cemetery was</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.825" end="00:51:59.325" style="s2">visible in the distance. It was always</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.625" end="00:52:01.925" style="s2">visible from this office.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.325" end="00:52:04.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m planning for the future. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.925" end="00:52:06.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew he was lying. I had watched him</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.325" end="00:52:08.725" style="s2">long enough to know the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.625" end="00:52:10.425" style="s2">He had no intention of finding peace. He</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.725" end="00:52:12.725" style="s2">was only making sure everything was in</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.425" end="00:52:15.325" style="s2">place before he left. The night before</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.725" end="00:52:16.925" style="s2">the fund&#39;s annual gala, Adrian sat at</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.325" end="00:52:19.425" style="s2">his desk.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.925" end="00:52:21.725" style="s2">He had already written his final letter.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.425" end="00:52:23.625" style="s2">He placed it in the box with the others.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.725" end="00:52:25.625" style="s2">Then he looked at the photo of us. In</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.625" end="00:52:27.625" style="s2">it, we were young and in love. We were</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.625" end="00:52:29.425" style="s2">at a park. I was laughing. He was</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.625" end="00:52:31.725" style="s2">holding me from behind, his chin on my</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.425" end="00:52:33.525" style="s2">shoulder. The sun was setting behind us.</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.725" end="00:52:35.125" style="s2">It was a perfect moment, a moment that</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.525" end="00:52:36.725" style="s2">should have lasted forever. He didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.125" end="00:52:38.025" style="s2">know then that he would lose me. He</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.725" end="00:52:39.525" style="s2">didn&#39;t know that the girl in the photo</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.025" end="00:52:41.125" style="s2">would die alone in a hospital bed. He</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.525" end="00:52:43.025" style="s2">didn&#39;t know that the baby she carried</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.125" end="00:52:44.025" style="s2">would die alone before he ever took a</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.025" end="00:52:45.525" style="s2">breath.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.025" end="00:52:46.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Nora.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.525" end="00:52:48.025" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry I couldn&#39;t be the man you</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.825" end="00:52:50.125" style="s2">deserved.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.025" end="00:52:52.125" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry I let my pride get in the way.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.125" end="00:52:54.125" style="s2">I &#39;m sorry I listened to her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.125" end="00:52:56.025" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry I didn&#39;t come.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.125" end="00:52:56.725" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry about everything, every single</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.025" end="00:53:00.425" style="s2">thing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.725" end="00:53:00.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He placed the photo back in the box.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.125" end="00:53:07.527" style="s2">Then he opened his nightstand drawer and</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.027" end="00:53:10.027" style="s2">took out a small case.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.527" end="00:53:11.927" style="s2">Inside was his service pistol. He looked</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.027" end="00:53:14.227" style="s2">at it for a long time. He weighed it in</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.927" end="00:53:16.827" style="s2">his hand. He checked the chamber. He had</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.227" end="00:53:19.127" style="s2">done this before many times,</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.827" end="00:53:21.727" style="s2">but he had always stopped. Not tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.127" end="00:53:23.827" style="s2">I watched him. I did not stop him. I</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.727" end="00:53:25.627" style="s2">could not stop him. He was not doing</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.827" end="00:53:27.027" style="s2">this out of despair. He was doing this</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.627" end="00:53:29.527" style="s2">because he had finally accepted the</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.027" end="00:53:31.227" style="s2">truth, the truth that he had killed us,</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.527" end="00:53:33.227" style="s2">and there was no coming back from that.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.227" end="00:53:34.627" style="s2">He set the pistol on the table. He</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.227" end="00:53:36.527" style="s2">looked at the sunrise outside the</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.627" end="00:53:38.027" style="s2">window.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.527" end="00:53:40.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more day.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.027" end="00:53:41.827" style="s2">One more thing and then I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.027" end="00:53:44.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He did not pull the trigger that night.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.827" end="00:53:46.527" style="s2">Instead, he put the pistol back in the</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.027" end="00:53:48.927" style="s2">drawer. He had one more thing to do, one</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.527" end="00:53:51.627" style="s2">more person to see. He needed to go to</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.927" end="00:53:53.627" style="s2">the gala. He needed to speak. He needed</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.627" end="00:53:55.527" style="s2">to see it through. The next morning, he</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.627" end="00:53:57.927" style="s2">dressed in his uniform,</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.527" end="00:53:59.727" style="s2">not his day-to-day uniform, his dress</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.927" end="00:54:00.927" style="s2">uniform, the one he had worn to the</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.727" end="00:54:02.927" style="s2">gala,</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.927" end="00:54:05.627" style="s2">the one he had worn when I bled to death</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.927" end="00:54:07.527" style="s2">on the walkway outside the reception.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.627" end="00:54:09.127" style="s2">He looked at himself in the mirror. He</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.527" end="00:54:10.827" style="s2">looked like the man who had failed me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.127" end="00:54:12.527" style="s2">The medals on his chest meant nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.827" end="00:54:14.127" style="s2">The rank on his collar meant nothing. He</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.527" end="00:54:16.127" style="s2">was just a man who had let his wife die</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.127" end="00:54:18.827" style="s2">alone. He did not smile. He did not</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.127" end="00:54:20.227" style="s2">adjust his collar. He just stared.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.827" end="00:54:22.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more thing,</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.227" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">then I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.627" end="00:54:27.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He walked to the cemetery. He did not</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.827" end="00:54:29.627" style="s2">bring coffee this time.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.327" end="00:54:31.627" style="s2">He stood before our grave.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.627" end="00:54:33.927" style="s2">He looked at the stone.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.627" end="00:54:35.927" style="s2">They waited. He had waited, too. He had</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.927" end="00:54:37.527" style="s2">waited to believe me. He had waited to</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.927" end="00:54:39.327" style="s2">come to the hospital. He had waited to</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.527" end="00:54:40.927" style="s2">be the man I needed, and by the time he</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.327" end="00:54:42.897" style="s2">did, it was too late.</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.927" end="00:54:44.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming home now</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.897" end="00:54:46.127" style="s2">[snorts] to you and Eli. I hope there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.627" end="00:54:47.427" style="s2">room for me. Hope you can forgive me. I</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.127" end="00:54:48.427" style="s2">know I don&#39;t deserve it, but I hope you</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.427" end="00:54:50.327" style="s2">can anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.427" end="00:54:52.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knelt and touched the stone. He</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.327" end="00:54:54.327" style="s2">stayed there for a long time. People</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.127" end="00:54:56.127" style="s2">walked past, joggers, families,</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.327" end="00:54:57.727" style="s2">children. No one stopped to ask why a</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.127" end="00:54:59.827" style="s2">man in a dress uniform was crying at a</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.727" end="00:55:01.727" style="s2">grave. He was past caring. When he stood</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.827" end="00:55:03.427" style="s2">up, he walked back to his apartment. I</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.727" end="00:55:05.427" style="s2">followed him. I knew what was coming.</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.427" end="00:55:07.527" style="s2">Dawn was breaking over the city. Adrian</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.427" end="00:55:09.228" style="s2">sat at the table. His service pistol lay</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.527" end="00:55:11.728" style="s2">in front of him. He had placed the box</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.228" end="00:55:13.328" style="s2">next to it. Inside were our photo, Eli&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.728" end="00:55:15.228" style="s2">bracelet, and all the letters he had</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.328" end="00:55:17.028" style="s2">written. He picked up my phone one last</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.228" end="00:55:20.328" style="s2">time. He scrolled through the messages,</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.028" end="00:55:22.228" style="s2">the 77 transfers, the 77 voice messages,</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.328" end="00:55:24.128" style="s2">the calls he had ignored, the pleas he</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.228" end="00:55:25.828" style="s2">had dismissed, the cries for help he had</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.128" end="00:55:26.728" style="s2">refused to hear. He played the last</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.828" end="00:55:28.028" style="s2">voice message.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.728" end="00:55:29.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, I don&#39;t know if you&#39;ll ever</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.028" end="00:55:31.628" style="s2">listen to these. If you do, I hope you</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.928" end="00:55:33.628" style="s2">know I wasn&#39;t trying to take anything</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.628" end="00:55:35.428" style="s2">from you. I only wanted you to know him.</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.628" end="00:55:37.128" style="s2">I wanted you to hear his heartbeat. I</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.428" end="00:55:38.428" style="s2">wanted you to be there. I wanted you to</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.128" end="00:55:40.128" style="s2">be his father. I wanted us to be a</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.428" end="00:55:41.428" style="s2">family. I wanted you to love us, but I</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.128" end="00:55:42.328" style="s2">don&#39;t think you ever did, and I think</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.428" end="00:55:44.028" style="s2">that&#39;s what hurts the most.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.328" end="00:55:46.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The recording ended. Adrian listened to</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.028" end="00:55:47.528" style="s2">it three times. Each time his face broke</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.128" end="00:55:50.128" style="s2">a little more. Then he put him down the</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.528" end="00:55:51.828" style="s2">phone. He picked up the pistol.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.128" end="00:55:53.228" style="s2">He looked at our photo.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.828" end="00:55:54.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be there soon.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.228" end="00:55:56.328" style="s2">Tell Eli I&#39;m sorry I wasn&#39;t there for</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.928" end="00:55:58.628" style="s2">his first breath. Tell him I&#39;ll be there</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.328" end="00:56:00.428" style="s2">for his last. Tell him I love him. Tell</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.628" end="00:56:01.328" style="s2">him I always did. I just didn&#39;t know how</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.428" end="00:56:05.128" style="s2">to show it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.328" end="00:56:05.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He pressed the barrel to his temple.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.028" end="00:56:09.328" style="s2">I felt a pull,</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.028" end="00:56:12.728" style="s2">a tug,</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.328" end="00:56:12.728" style="s2">a force drawing me upward.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.328" end="00:56:16.628" style="s2">And then I saw a light.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.528" end="00:56:24.228" style="s2">A voice spoke in the silence.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.028" end="00:56:26.928" style="s2">It&#39;s time to go.</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.228" end="00:56:28.828" style="s2">You&#39;ve been watching for too long.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.928" end="00:56:30.928" style="s2">You&#39;ve been stuck in the space between</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.828" end="00:56:34.228" style="s2">living and dying.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.928" end="00:56:36.528" style="s2">Now it&#39;s time to move on.</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.228" end="00:56:38.928" style="s2">I looked back, saw the world below, the</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.528" end="00:56:40.628" style="s2">apartment, the cemetery, and then I saw</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.928" end="00:56:42.528" style="s2">him, Adrian. He was standing in the</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.628" end="00:56:43.928" style="s2">light. He looked young, the man I had</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.528" end="00:56:45.428" style="s2">fallen in love with, the man who had</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.928" end="00:56:46.928" style="s2">fought his family for me, the man who</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.428" end="00:56:48.528" style="s2">had promised to make me the happiest</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.928" end="00:56:49.328" style="s2">officer&#39;s wife in the world. He reached</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.528" end="00:56:51.128" style="s2">out his hand.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.328" end="00:56:52.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.128" end="00:56:53.528" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry for everything. I&#39;m sorry I</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.328" end="00:56:55.528" style="s2">didn&#39;t believe you. I&#39;m sorry I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.528" end="00:56:57.528" style="s2">come. I&#39;m sorry I left you alone. I &#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.528" end="00:56:59.128" style="s2">sorry I made you die alone. I&#39;m sorry</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.528" end="00:57:00.628" style="s2">about Eli. I &#39;m sorry about all of it. I</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.128" end="00:57:02.928" style="s2">know I don&#39;t deserve your forgiveness,</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.628" end="00:57:04.028" style="s2">but I want you to know that I loved you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.928" end="00:57:05.428" style="s2">I loved you the whole time. I just</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.028" end="00:57:07.128" style="s2">didn&#39;t know how to show it, and now it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.428" end="00:57:08.928" style="s2">too late.</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.128" end="00:57:12.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I looked at him,</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.928" end="00:57:14.929" style="s2">and And first time, I felt something.</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.829" end="00:57:16.429" style="s2">Not forgiveness,</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.929" end="00:57:18.929" style="s2">not love,</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.429" end="00:57:22.329" style="s2">but peace.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.929" end="00:57:22.329" style="s2">I took one step forward.</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.229" end="00:57:29.029" style="s2">And then I woke up.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.129" end="00:57:30.529" style="s2">I opened my eyes. I was in a small room,</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.029" end="00:57:33.229" style="s2">a dormitory.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.529" end="00:57:34.529" style="s2">Sunlight streamed through the curtains.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.229" end="00:57:37.429" style="s2">I sat up.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.529" end="00:57:40.129" style="s2">I looked at my hands. They were young,</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.429" end="00:57:40.129" style="s2">no ring.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.029" end="00:57:44.429" style="s2">I ran to the mirror.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.729" end="00:57:46.729" style="s2">I was 18 again. I looked at my</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.429" end="00:57:49.029" style="s2">reflection. It was me, but it was not</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.729" end="00:57:52.329" style="s2">the me who had died. I was young, I was</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.029" end="00:57:54.829" style="s2">healthy, I was alive. No, it couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.329" end="00:57:57.129" style="s2">be. It was impossible. I picked up my</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.829" end="00:57:59.029" style="s2">phone to check the date. It was the year</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.129" end="00:58:01.729" style="s2">before I met Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.029" end="00:58:04.029" style="s2">I had been given a second chance.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.729" end="00:58:05.429" style="s2">I sat on the bed and began to cry. I</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.029" end="00:58:08.329" style="s2">couldn&#39;t tell which emotion was</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.429" end="00:58:10.129" style="s2">stronger, relief, joy, panic, or</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.329" end="00:58:12.229" style="s2">disbelief.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.129" end="00:58:14.429" style="s2">I could change everything.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.229" end="00:58:15.829" style="s2">I could avoid him. I could save myself.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.429" end="00:58:18.129" style="s2">I could save my mother. I could save</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.829" end="00:58:19.829" style="s2">Eli. I could save all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.129" end="00:58:21.729" style="s2">I looked out the window. The sun was</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.829" end="00:58:24.929" style="s2">shining. The birds were singing. The</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.729" end="00:58:27.329" style="s2">world was young and full of possibility.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.929" end="00:58:30.829" style="s2">I made a promise to myself.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.329" end="00:58:30.829" style="s2">I will never let that happen again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.929" end="00:58:34.729" style="s2">I will never trust him.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.529" end="00:58:35.929" style="s2">I will never love him.</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.729" end="00:58:38.429" style="s2">I will never give him the chance to</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.929" end="00:58:38.429" style="s2">break me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.229" end="00:58:43.129" style="s2">The days passed. I adjusted to being 18</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.029" end="00:58:44.929" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.129" end="00:58:46.629" style="s2">But I was not the same person I had been</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.929" end="00:58:48.029" style="s2">the first time around.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.629" end="00:58:50.829" style="s2">I was older,</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.029" end="00:58:52.929" style="s2">wiser, more cautious.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.829" end="00:58:55.929" style="s2">I saw the world differently. I saw</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.929" end="00:58:58.129" style="s2">Adrian once in the cafeteria.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.929" end="00:59:00.529" style="s2">He was young and handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.129" end="00:59:02.429" style="s2">He was with his friends.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.529" end="00:59:05.529" style="s2">He didn&#39;t see me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.429" end="00:59:07.829" style="s2">And I felt nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.529" end="00:59:09.429" style="s2">He was nothing to me now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.829" end="00:59:11.929" style="s2">And I was free.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.429" end="00:59:14.531" style="s2">One of his friends pointed at me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.929" end="00:59:16.431" style="s2">He whispered something to Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.531" end="00:59:19.131" style="s2">Adrian looked up.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.431" end="00:59:22.331" style="s2">He looked at me for a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.131" end="00:59:24.531" style="s2">And then he smiled.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.331" end="00:59:26.031" style="s2">He started to walk toward me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.531" end="00:59:28.331" style="s2">I knew what was coming.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.031" end="00:59:29.931" style="s2">I knew this moment. I knew this meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.331" end="00:59:31.331" style="s2">It was the moment I had first fallen in</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.931" end="00:59:33.231" style="s2">love with him.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.331" end="00:59:35.531" style="s2">But I didn&#39;t let it happen. I turned</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.231" end="00:59:37.031" style="s2">around. I walked away.</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.531" end="00:59:38.131" style="s2">I heard him call out.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.031" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, wait.</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.131" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">I&#39;m Adrian. What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.031" end="00:59:46.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not look back. This time I did not</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.931" end="00:59:48.031" style="s2">choose him.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.331" end="00:59:51.031" style="s2">The sun was setting.</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.031" end="00:59:52.731" style="s2">The sky was orange and red.</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.031" end="00:59:57.931" style="s2">I believe that the future holds for me a</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.731" end="00:59:57.931" style="s2">brand new, joyful and wonderful life.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
